WEBVTT

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.880
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.320
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.000
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.920
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.540
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.290
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.000
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.290
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.290
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:59.940
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.620
What is this, Manasa?

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:15.630
I didn't expect you to confess
your feelings like this.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.580
I like you, Arjun.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.920
This didn't happen out of the blue.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:33.670
Since the first time I met you

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.290
I've had a good impression on you.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.850
And I fell in love eventually.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.620
I didn't know this was
on your mind, Manasa.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.850
I don't have any such intention.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.170
In case..

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.260
I had influenced you
with my actions..

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.330
I am extremely sorry for that.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.580
Why, Arjun?

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.460
I didn't ask you to make
a commitment immediately.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.340
Let's date.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.170
Then we'll see.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.840
Is it Reena?

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:13.910
Seriously, Arjun.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.140
Reena said that she is
seeing you only as a friend.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.990
After that, there is nothing
between you and her.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:24.460
Then why are you stuck
in the past? - Look, Manasa.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.370
It's not that simple.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:30.840
Just because you confessed,
I can't date you.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.500
I should feel it too.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.690
Didn't you ever feel
that way about me?

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:39.690
No.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:43.380
And I am sorry.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.540
Let's not talk about
this anymore, Manasa.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.080
Please.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.160
And as I said earlier

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:58.380
I am sorry if I was
the reason for your feelings.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.290
Also..

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.800
I love Reena.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.290
And I will continue to love Reena.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:26.740
Radhi.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:34.920
Is it true what I heard?

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.820
Your husband said
that he will come back?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.380
But he has asked for some time.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.390
That's a good thing.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.330
Why are you sad?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.390
But..

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.010
I feel that all the problems
will start only after this.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.170
Dev, Vijay, Reena.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.790
I don't know how to deal
with all three of them.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.500
So, what are you planning to do?

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:15.130
I am planning to tell
the truth to Dev and Vijay.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.580
Think about it carefully.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.540
If you tell the truth to Vijay,
it's like telling it to Reena.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.790
Reena is coming here often.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.500
She is in front of you,
you can see her.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.620
What if Vijay takes
Reena with him?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.200
Leave that.

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.380
Your husband was furious
after learning part of the truth.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.290
You know how long it
took us to calm him down.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:46.130
What will he do if he comes
to know the whole truth?

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.080
Forget about all this.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.570
I know that you are acting
tough in front of Reena.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.000
I know that it's just a facade.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.080
Because deep down

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:03.380
you are glad that she is visiting
often and that you can see her now.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.510
Are you asking me to lie
to everyone for that?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.880
This is not a lie.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:11.670
You saw what happened
when I hid the truth last time.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.080
Why should I repeat
the same mistake?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.200
Look.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.380
I told you what I felt.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.040
Now, it's your turn
to think about it.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.540
Think about it carefully.

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:42.500
Excuse me, sir.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.480
Hi, sir.
- What brings you here, Reena?

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:52.760
I came to thank you.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.780
Dev and Dr. Radhi
have gotten back together.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.880
You played a big part in it.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.890
So, I came to thank you.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.270
Did Dev and Radhi
get back together?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.830
Yes, sir.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.000
Why are you so surprised?

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.100
Nothing.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:10.580
You got them back
together immediately.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:11.560
Good job.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:14.860
Anyway..

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.170
Thank you, sir.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.680
And sorry, sir.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.850
Why are you apologising?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:26.580
There was a conflict between us.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.580
I was arguing with you
about many things.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.000
Sorry, sir.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.170
It's okay, Reena.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.730
I don't take it personally.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:39.170
It's good that you are
questioning your seniors.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.290
Good for you.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.150
Thank you, sir.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.940
I came to say this.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.370
I'll leave now.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.080
Reena.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.700
You are escaping very soon.
- Oh, no!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.870
He remembers it.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:59.050
You said that you would
find out the reason

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.010
for Radhi and Dev's separation
if they got back together.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.300
I think he won't forget it.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.040
What's the use of that now?

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.920
They have gotten back together.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.480
Simple.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:14.880
No.

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:16.730
Actually..

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.820
I don't know the reason.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.580
Give me some time.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.380
I'll find out the reason.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.000
Your time has started.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.260
Find out the reason.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.130
Thank you, sir.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.420
I escaped.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.080
Are you sure, Anitha?

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:37.460
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.000
Why suddenly?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.130
I'm going to meet my parents.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.210
I really miss them.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.960
Guna's mother died recently.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.710
Arjun's parents are no more.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.790
Though I have my parents,
I don't visit them.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:03.630
It's difficult for them
to travel from the US.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.580
At least, I want to go there
and meet them.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:08.960
Yeah.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:10.460
I understand, Anitha.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.360
But don't forget one thing.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.540
You are one of the finest and
promising doctors in RK Hospital.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.040
You have all the qualities
to become a chief doctor.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:25.530
So, think well before
you take any decision.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.580
Thank you, ma'am.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.080
But I've already decided.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.960
Since I joined this hospital
as an intern

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:39.130
I've always prioritised
the patients and their families.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.380
Yeah.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.960
I didn't prioritise my parents.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:46.920
I haven't done much
for them till now.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.200
At least now, I want to spend
some time with them.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:56.170
And I need the space, I think.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:03.000
Ma'am, you told me that
I can take a break if I want.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.260
I need it right now.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.000
I really need it.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.840
Fair. I understand.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.840
But please come back soon.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.040
You are always
needed in this hospital.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.630
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:19.750
I'll definitely come.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.090
All the best.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.790
Bye.
- Yeah, thank you.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:49.570
Sorry.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.130
I told you, Manasa.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.790
Arjun doesn't fall for it easily.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.680
Arjun will love Reena till the end.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:59.140
Did you need this insult?

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:09.250
You tried to take over the hospital
by impressing Arjun.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.130
But did it work out?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.960
Everything ended up as a failure.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.000
This doesn't suit you, Manasa.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.930
Shall I tell you one more thing?

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.460
You are not evil.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.700
You are deceiving not only us.
You are deceiving yourself.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.680
I shouldn't advise
you as a brother.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.170
But I'll tell you one thing.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:39.190
Go back to where you came from.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.350
If you want to stay here

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.980
just mind your own business.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:47.210
Don't try to take
over the hospital.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.840
Don't get insulted again and again.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.880
Be careful from now on.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.300
I'll leave now, bye, Sister.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:16.460
Doctor.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:17.850
What happened, Kamal?

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.240
Sir, it was an accident.
There were three of them.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.670
The parents and a little girl.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:23.920
Okay..

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:28.960
Everything will be fine.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.100
Don't cry.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:33.080
Mom..

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.090
Hey.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:35.960
What is your name?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.590
Krithika.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.590
What happened?

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.040
I don't know.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.590
I was sleeping.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.290
Suddenly, I heard a loud noise.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:49.070
When I woke up,
I was covered in blood.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.840
The car had hit a tree.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.250
Okay..

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:55.090
You are fine now.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:58.000
Do one thing.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.540
Stay in the waiting room.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.750
After attending to your parents

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.500
I'll come and meet you.

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:04.540
Okay?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.460
Nurse.
- Sir.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.790
Take her to the waiting room.
- Okay, sir, come.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.090
Did you do the assessment?

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.300
Yes, sir.

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.400
Her mother..

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:25.500
Her mother passed away, sir.

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.420
Her father has suffered
a severe head injury.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.500
He is unconscious.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:29.920
His pupils are dilated.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:31.880
He might have STH.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.210
He has severe head trauma.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.130
His GCU is 3 by 15.

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.710
It's a very poor prognosis, sir.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.250
We can't say anything now.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.750
We have to wait and see.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.590
Does she know about this?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:43.750
No.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.340
Does she have an attendant?

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:47.880
We asked her.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:49.840
She won't tell us anything.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:53.290
I'll take care of her.
- Okay, sir.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.790
Check for surgical intervention.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:56.790
Okay, sir.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.000
Krithika.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.710
Do you know any of your
relatives' phone numbers?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.120
I have to call them.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.540
We don't have anyone.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:29.880
It's just us.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.840
Nothing happened
to my parents, right, uncle?

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:39.740
Even my father was
treated by the doctors there.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.590
But no one did anything
to my mother.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.790
Nothing happened
to my mother, right, uncle?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.830
Both of them are critical now.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.330
Your father has suffered
a severe head injury.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.170
That's why we are attending to him.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.380
I came here to encourage you.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:00.960
That's important.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.670
They are getting
the best support from us.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.920
I'll let you know whatever
happens to them.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.630
We are monitoring them, okay?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.540
Take care.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:52.470
Try to collect her family
background details. - Okay, sir.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:57.750
Try to collect her school records,
address and relatives' numbers.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:14:59.090
Okay, sir.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:03.130
Until then, don't tell her
that her mother is dead.

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:07.000
Focus on her father's recovery.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.460
I understand, sir, okay.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:38.000
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.410
Dr. Anitha.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.450
They asked me to give this to you.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:34.740
Okay, I'll take care of it,
thank you.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.880
Who did this?

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.190
Senior.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:57.670
Who do you think will come
up with such brilliant ideas?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.480
That's what I'm asking.
Who will do it?

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:02.040
Who else, senior? It's me.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.170
Am I going to leave forever?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.090
I'm going on leave.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.840
Leave? Senior.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.760
You can take a leave
for a day or for a week.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.380
But you are going away for good.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.170
That's called extended leave.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.210
Let it be.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.460
We'll miss you a lot
when you are not here.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.350
The parties will be boring
without you, senior.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.500
Don't you think this is too much?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.960
You don't care about me
when I'm here.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.250
You don't even talk to me.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:29.740
Now, you are acting as if you're
going to die from my absence.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.340
That's how it is, senior.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:33.840
By the way..

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.810
Are you going to vacate your house?

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:39.630
I knew it.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.460
I was wondering
why you haven't asked it yet.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.710
Is that why you bought this cake?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.080
Look.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.370
She is going to vacate the house.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.960
But she is not going
to rent out the house.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.130
Do you understand?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.750
Senior, I heard that
you are going on leave.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:00.460
Yes, Reena, I'm going on leave.

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:02.590
Sorry, senior.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:05.500
I behaved rudely to you.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.590
I'm sorry.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:07.880
That's not a big deal.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.790
I would have done the same
if I were in your place.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.500
Leave it.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.510
I need to talk to you.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.670
Tell me, senior.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:16.940
Sit down.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:24.640
Reena, after I leave, Arjun
won't have anyone in this hospital.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.210
Only you.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.490
I'll leave in some time.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.930
Will you take care of him?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.670
Otherwise, he will end up
going to counselling.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.670
But he doesn't need it now.

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:41.000
He needs only you.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.500
So, you should take care of him.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.000
Will you take care of him?

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.790
Senior, do you
have to say all this?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.880
I'll take care of him.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.420
Okay, get up.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:55.760
Get up.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.590
Get up, senior.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.040
Get up.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:00.670
What's this, Reena?

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.340
I'll also come.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:07.920
What's this, senior?

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:42.100
Senior, shall we cut the cake?
- What?

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.390
Won't you let go of the cake?

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.080
Okay, let's cut the cake.
- Come.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.250
You'll come back soon, right?

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.790
Is it?
Do I have to come back?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.130
Okay, I'll come.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.750
Hey, I'm serious.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:38.920
Oh, wow!

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:39.960
I'll come, sir.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:40.960
I'll come.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.000
You take care, okay?

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:47.470
Hey..

00:21:52.162 --> 00:21:55.162
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:21:57.202 --> 00:21:59.712
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:22:02.262 --> 00:22:05.142
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:22:06.932 --> 00:22:09.272
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:22:09.372 --> 00:22:11.912
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:22:11.962 --> 00:22:14.752
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:22:14.832 --> 00:22:17.362
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:22:19.622 --> 00:22:22.262
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:22:24.662 --> 00:22:27.152
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:22:29.082 --> 00:22:33.292
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:22:52.832 --> 00:22:54.562
Anitha has left, right?

00:22:55.912 --> 00:22:56.872
Yes, she has left.

00:22:57.502 --> 00:22:58.622
Whatever it is..

00:23:00.692 --> 00:23:02.672
I feel bad that she has left.

00:23:03.752 --> 00:23:04.752
It's not like that, Reena.

00:23:05.582 --> 00:23:06.792
It was like that for me, too.

00:23:07.922 --> 00:23:09.122
But when I think about it

00:23:10.172 --> 00:23:11.372
she needs a break.

00:23:12.622 --> 00:23:14.482
Poor thing, she has
been through a lot.

00:23:16.462 --> 00:23:18.042
I understand that, Arjun.

00:23:18.832 --> 00:23:20.292
But I will miss her a lot.

00:23:21.282 --> 00:23:25.122
In the hospital, while working,
while going out..

00:23:25.312 --> 00:23:26.212
Why?

00:23:26.722 --> 00:23:28.172
Because you don't have
anyone to fight with?

00:23:35.292 --> 00:23:36.172
Reena.

00:23:39.502 --> 00:23:40.672
Manasa..

00:23:41.472 --> 00:23:42.292
Yes.

00:23:44.462 --> 00:23:45.312
She..

00:23:47.122 --> 00:23:48.332
She proposed to me.

00:23:49.502 --> 00:23:50.962
You are saying it
like it's something new.

00:23:51.212 --> 00:23:52.832
This is already known.

00:23:54.672 --> 00:23:55.792
How did you know?

00:23:56.912 --> 00:23:59.352
When she sees you,
she adjusts her hair.

00:23:59.622 --> 00:24:01.772
She smiles flirtatiously.

00:24:02.042 --> 00:24:05.172
She calls you Arjun
in a gentle voice.

00:24:08.742 --> 00:24:09.712
Okay.

00:24:10.462 --> 00:24:11.672
What did you say for that?

00:24:12.962 --> 00:24:14.372
What do you want me to say?

00:24:15.582 --> 00:24:16.662
I don't know.

00:24:19.542 --> 00:24:20.462
Reena.

00:24:21.872 --> 00:24:23.082
I know that you like me.

00:24:24.322 --> 00:24:26.252
And of course, there are
a lot of conflicts between us.

00:24:27.042 --> 00:24:29.632
But still,
we like to reach out to each other.

00:24:31.532 --> 00:24:35.212
But you are not thinking
of bringing this to the next stage.

00:24:36.502 --> 00:24:37.772
I agree.

00:24:38.292 --> 00:24:41.332
I shouldn't have told the relation
between you and Dr. Radhi.

00:24:42.222 --> 00:24:43.382
What I did was wrong.

00:24:43.712 --> 00:24:44.962
I regret whatever I did.

00:24:47.502 --> 00:24:49.382
Even if there are
a lot of problems

00:24:51.082 --> 00:24:52.002
on other hand..

00:24:52.302 --> 00:24:55.382
The questions in your life
are getting towards closure.

00:24:56.172 --> 00:24:58.742
I'm not justifying what I did.

00:25:00.982 --> 00:25:02.632
I just want to put it behind us.

00:25:06.792 --> 00:25:07.632
What do you say?

00:25:12.792 --> 00:25:14.332
I said what I wanted to say.

00:25:15.212 --> 00:25:17.882
Now, Manasa has proposed to me.

00:25:18.292 --> 00:25:21.172
I might get a lot
of proposals in the future.

00:25:22.372 --> 00:25:23.392
It's your wish now.

00:25:24.702 --> 00:25:25.622
What do you say?

00:25:31.072 --> 00:25:32.342
Hello? Tell me, Uncle.

00:25:32.452 --> 00:25:33.712
Reena, where are you?

00:25:34.502 --> 00:25:36.952
Saradha has fainted,
come home soon.

00:25:37.042 --> 00:25:38.042
I am scared!

00:25:39.182 --> 00:25:41.712
What happened, Uncle?
- Please come fast..

00:25:42.322 --> 00:25:43.462
What happened, Reena?
- I'm coming..

00:25:57.352 --> 00:26:00.462
Aunty..

00:26:01.152 --> 00:26:02.582
Aunty..
Uncle, what happened?

00:26:02.692 --> 00:26:04.422
We both went out and came back.
- Hey..

00:26:04.542 --> 00:26:06.832
She said she will sleep
here as she was dizzy. - Aunty..

00:26:06.992 --> 00:26:08.212
I asked her to sleep.

00:26:08.872 --> 00:26:12.332
Now she won't get up. I'm scared.
- Aunty..

00:26:13.582 --> 00:26:17.042
Arjun, the pulse is decreasing.
Call the ambulance, quick.

00:26:17.712 --> 00:26:19.692
Aunty..

00:26:20.172 --> 00:26:21.092
Aunty.

00:26:40.002 --> 00:26:41.172
Reena, what happened?

00:26:41.512 --> 00:26:43.752
Ma'am..
When I went home

00:26:43.892 --> 00:26:46.542
her body was chill to the touch.

00:26:46.712 --> 00:26:49.252
Reena..
- Her pulse is dropping.

00:26:50.062 --> 00:26:52.002
I don't know what to do.
- Reena.

00:26:52.262 --> 00:26:53.462
Ma'am, her pulse is dropping.

00:26:53.642 --> 00:26:56.422
Aunty, I don't know what to do.

00:26:56.502 --> 00:26:58.662
Reena, calm down.
- Aunty..

00:26:58.792 --> 00:26:59.682
Calm down.

00:27:00.232 --> 00:27:02.462
No, ma'am.
Aunty..

00:27:02.712 --> 00:27:04.332
Teju, Rocky, check the ECG.

00:27:05.712 --> 00:27:08.812
Ma'am, I will do it..

00:27:08.962 --> 00:27:09.792
I will take care.

00:27:09.832 --> 00:27:11.462
No, Reena, you are
not in your right mind now.

00:27:13.042 --> 00:27:14.752
Ma'am, I will take care of it.

00:27:15.962 --> 00:27:19.412
Ma'am, only I know
her medical history.

00:27:19.632 --> 00:27:20.502
Please, ma'am.

00:27:20.582 --> 00:27:23.212
Reena, listen to me.
- Please..

00:27:23.472 --> 00:27:25.832
Ma'am, after Sonia..

00:27:26.462 --> 00:27:30.212
I only have my aunt
and uncle in my life.

00:27:30.492 --> 00:27:31.672
I am scared.

00:27:31.902 --> 00:27:33.922
Nothing should happen to her.

00:27:34.102 --> 00:27:35.352
I will attend to her.

00:27:35.392 --> 00:27:36.372
Please let me.

00:27:36.672 --> 00:27:39.042
Reena, you know
we will do our best.

00:27:39.372 --> 00:27:40.622
Go out.
- Ma'am..

00:27:41.092 --> 00:27:42.462
You go out.
- Please..

00:27:42.752 --> 00:27:43.962
You check thoroughly.

00:27:44.892 --> 00:27:45.792
You come.
- Ma'am..

00:27:45.952 --> 00:27:48.502
No, you come.
- Aunty..

00:27:54.812 --> 00:27:55.832
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:27:57.252 --> 00:27:58.122
What is the status?

00:27:58.422 --> 00:28:01.332
Ma'am, we took an ECG.
Acute MI, inferior volume MI.

00:28:01.412 --> 00:28:02.752
It's a positive tropy.

00:28:02.962 --> 00:28:05.542
We have given her heparin
and loading dosage.

00:28:05.712 --> 00:28:08.922
As per the cardiologist's advice,
we have done a thrombolysis.

00:28:09.092 --> 00:28:11.042
BP is low, 80-50.

00:28:11.112 --> 00:28:12.962
Saturation level is below 90.

00:28:13.042 --> 00:28:14.082
She is very sick.

00:28:15.332 --> 00:28:17.422
Ma'am, this is like the starting
stage of heart failure.

00:28:17.642 --> 00:28:19.372
I think her EF level is very low.

00:28:19.642 --> 00:28:21.042
Shall we take an ECHO?

00:28:22.222 --> 00:28:25.872
But Saradha doesn't have
any history of cardiac issues.

00:28:26.772 --> 00:28:28.502
She doesn't have a history of it?

00:28:29.712 --> 00:28:31.462
No, ma'am, Reena has told me

00:28:31.502 --> 00:28:33.712
that her aunt
had cardiac issues before.

00:28:33.882 --> 00:28:35.872
She had fatigue and palpitations.

00:28:35.962 --> 00:28:37.672
But she didn't
follow up regularly.

00:28:40.212 --> 00:28:43.652
Ma'am, I will ask for an ECHO
and get an OT ready.

00:28:43.872 --> 00:28:47.212
Let us confirm our guesses
and proceed to the next treatment.

00:28:47.462 --> 00:28:48.462
Good job, Rocky.

00:28:49.252 --> 00:28:52.102
Ma'am, her BP is dropping.
Shall we start inotropics?

00:28:52.212 --> 00:28:53.212
Start it immediately.

00:28:53.622 --> 00:28:58.692
Prescribe the tests immediately.
Do it as fast as possible.

00:28:58.792 --> 00:28:59.752
Sure, ma'am.

00:29:07.012 --> 00:29:08.042
Rocky.

00:29:09.042 --> 00:29:12.352
I have never seen you
so involved in any case.

00:29:13.002 --> 00:29:15.082
What is the matter?
Why are you so serious?

00:29:16.252 --> 00:29:18.042
Teju, did you see Reena?

00:29:18.672 --> 00:29:19.892
She is so broken.

00:29:21.302 --> 00:29:23.922
I know how important Ganesh
and Saradha are to Reena.

00:29:24.642 --> 00:29:26.922
I know Ganesh and
Saradha only through Reena.

00:29:27.312 --> 00:29:30.542
But.. They call me a lot
to inquire about Reena.

00:29:30.982 --> 00:29:34.422
Gradually.. I got emotionally
attached to them.

00:29:34.892 --> 00:29:37.462
Now, I can't keep quiet
when they are in pain.

00:29:37.542 --> 00:29:40.122
I want to help them
as much as I can.

00:29:41.832 --> 00:29:42.712
Then, Teju..

00:29:43.162 --> 00:29:45.502
I treat all my patients seriously.

00:29:47.432 --> 00:29:48.422
Okay, go.

00:29:48.622 --> 00:29:50.312
Prescribe the tests.

00:29:57.482 --> 00:29:58.302
What is the update?

00:29:58.622 --> 00:30:01.042
Sir, we have found
Krithika's relatives.

00:30:01.572 --> 00:30:04.872
Her grandparents' names
were in her dad's insurance.

00:30:04.962 --> 00:30:06.632
Okay, when are they coming?

00:30:07.432 --> 00:30:08.422
Sir..

00:30:09.542 --> 00:30:11.002
No one is ready to come.

00:30:11.672 --> 00:30:13.652
Her grandma said
that she won't come.

00:30:15.172 --> 00:30:17.262
She could have come
for the sake of that girl.

00:30:17.772 --> 00:30:19.632
It's painful to think about that.

00:30:25.572 --> 00:30:27.942
Okay, call that girl.
I will talk to her.

00:30:28.542 --> 00:30:30.042
This is part of our job.
You gotta do this.

00:30:49.442 --> 00:30:50.372
Krithika.

00:30:54.052 --> 00:30:55.712
I am going to tell you
something difficult.

00:30:57.642 --> 00:30:59.042
You need to be strong, okay?

00:31:01.932 --> 00:31:03.082
Your mother..

00:31:04.072 --> 00:31:05.632
Did my mom pass away?

00:31:10.082 --> 00:31:11.382
Yes, dear.

00:31:16.552 --> 00:31:21.152
Your father is critical,
and we have kept him on a ventilator.

00:31:22.622 --> 00:31:24.462
We are doing our
best to save him, okay?

00:31:28.072 --> 00:31:29.792
If anyone from your family came

00:31:30.462 --> 00:31:31.902
we wanted to inform them.

00:31:33.122 --> 00:31:35.672
My grandpa and grandma
don't like my parents.

00:31:37.002 --> 00:31:39.112
Since they eloped and got married

00:31:39.412 --> 00:31:42.252
my grandpa and grandma
don't like them at all.

00:31:42.302 --> 00:31:43.302
Oh..

00:31:44.172 --> 00:31:45.252
I am so sorry.

00:31:59.092 --> 00:32:00.262
Kamal.
- Sir.

00:32:01.702 --> 00:32:03.562
Make her wait in the waiting room.

00:32:03.902 --> 00:32:06.382
Make sure that there is a nurse
with her all the time. - Okay, sir.

00:32:15.662 --> 00:32:16.512
Krithika.

00:32:17.292 --> 00:32:18.662
Krithika, come, dear.

00:32:19.502 --> 00:32:20.712
Come, let's go.

00:32:27.662 --> 00:32:28.492
Sir..

00:32:28.922 --> 00:32:31.922
I feel like we shouldn't
have told her about this now.

00:32:34.372 --> 00:32:35.632
We were actually late.

00:32:37.052 --> 00:32:39.312
It's a difficult thing to do,
but it's the right thing to do.

00:32:42.602 --> 00:32:44.752
Sir, I have a suggestion.

00:32:46.882 --> 00:32:51.882
I think we should get
Dr. Reena to talk to Krithika.

00:32:52.142 --> 00:32:53.102
Why Dr. Reena?

00:32:54.052 --> 00:32:57.082
Because Dr. Reena
grew up in an orphanage.

00:32:57.172 --> 00:33:00.462
So, I think it would be right
to get her to talk to her.

00:33:01.722 --> 00:33:03.382
Did Reena grow up in an orphanage?

00:33:03.732 --> 00:33:04.712
Yes, sir.

00:33:09.752 --> 00:33:11.212
O-Okay.

00:33:21.542 --> 00:33:22.792
Hey.
- Hey.

00:33:24.762 --> 00:33:27.542
So, shall I ask my parents
to come to your house?

00:33:28.222 --> 00:33:29.082
Why?

00:33:29.712 --> 00:33:30.712
To ask for your hand in marriage.

00:33:31.002 --> 00:33:32.532
We have to talk
about marriage, right?

00:33:33.372 --> 00:33:34.542
Marriage?

00:33:35.252 --> 00:33:36.922
Why are you asking like this?

00:33:39.462 --> 00:33:40.952
There is a problem, Nilofer.

00:33:41.332 --> 00:33:42.182
What?

00:33:42.332 --> 00:33:43.722
My family won't agree to this.

00:33:45.462 --> 00:33:47.642
What do you mean? It's
actually the other way around.

00:33:48.182 --> 00:33:49.542
I am serious, Nilofer.

00:33:49.712 --> 00:33:51.132
Why won't they agree?

00:33:54.162 --> 00:33:55.292
I have a sister.

00:33:57.102 --> 00:33:59.582
They won't discuss my marriage
until she is married.

00:34:00.792 --> 00:34:01.702
You have a sister?

00:34:02.332 --> 00:34:03.612
You said you are the only son.

00:34:04.052 --> 00:34:04.972
Hey, you fool.

00:34:05.032 --> 00:34:06.922
I'm the only son
even if I have a sister.

00:34:08.672 --> 00:34:09.672
That's not what I meant.

00:34:10.222 --> 00:34:11.962
You never said
that you have a sister.

00:34:13.912 --> 00:34:15.332
Is it just one sister?

00:34:15.462 --> 00:34:17.322
Or..
- Just one sister.

00:34:19.312 --> 00:34:21.722
Nilofer, I have
come to your house.

00:34:22.022 --> 00:34:23.422
I have met your family.

00:34:23.962 --> 00:34:28.792
But you don't know anything
about me or my family.

00:34:29.832 --> 00:34:31.332
So, what's your point?

00:34:32.412 --> 00:34:34.562
Let us date for five to six months.

00:34:34.962 --> 00:34:36.292
Let's get to know
each other better.

00:34:36.902 --> 00:34:38.712
Then we can talk about marriage.

00:34:39.152 --> 00:34:40.212
Think about it.

00:34:45.722 --> 00:34:46.652
Okay.

00:34:47.572 --> 00:34:50.042
It's my responsibility
to get your sister married.

00:34:50.222 --> 00:34:53.172
That's not an easy task, Nilofer.

00:34:53.802 --> 00:34:55.002
I will take care of it.

00:34:55.422 --> 00:34:57.212
If your sister's marriage
is your problem

00:34:57.332 --> 00:34:58.672
I will solve it.

00:34:58.792 --> 00:35:00.332
That's my problem now.

00:35:01.272 --> 00:35:02.212
I have warned you.

00:35:02.642 --> 00:35:03.582
It's up to you now.

00:35:03.962 --> 00:35:04.922
I will take care of it.

00:35:10.562 --> 00:35:12.512
Rocky, how is Saradha?

00:35:13.962 --> 00:35:17.902
Her heart condition
is worse than we thought.

00:35:18.002 --> 00:35:20.962
Her heart's PF level is very low.

00:35:21.592 --> 00:35:24.752
It couldn't supply
enough blood to her organs.

00:35:25.622 --> 00:35:26.632
MI?

00:35:27.962 --> 00:35:28.872
Inferior valve MI.

00:35:29.082 --> 00:35:30.582
How did it happen so suddenly?

00:35:30.912 --> 00:35:32.832
She doesn't have any heart issues.

00:35:33.232 --> 00:35:34.082
Uncle.

00:35:34.822 --> 00:35:36.462
It starts slowly.

00:35:36.832 --> 00:35:38.062
Suddenly, it gets critical.

00:35:39.672 --> 00:35:41.452
Aunty has heart failure.

00:35:42.292 --> 00:35:43.872
We can't do an angiogram.

00:35:44.672 --> 00:35:46.422
Her heart is very weak.

00:35:46.622 --> 00:35:48.002
So we can't do
an open-heart surgery either.

00:35:48.132 --> 00:35:49.462
What do I do?

00:35:50.722 --> 00:35:54.502
The only option we have now
is to do a heart transplant.

00:35:56.252 --> 00:35:57.382
Saradha..

00:36:00.252 --> 00:36:01.782
What do I do..

00:36:02.302 --> 00:36:03.292
Uncle..

00:36:04.462 --> 00:36:07.382
Oh, no.. I'm scared..

00:36:24.832 --> 00:36:26.292
Did your mom die?

00:36:30.332 --> 00:36:31.262
Your dad?

00:36:34.172 --> 00:36:35.372
Your friends?

00:36:38.702 --> 00:36:40.402
For whom are you crying?

00:36:42.292 --> 00:37:12.292
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

00:36:42.542 --> 00:36:44.952
For my landlady..

00:36:46.292 --> 00:36:47.422
Your landlady?

00:36:54.542 --> 00:36:55.502
You?

00:36:56.412 --> 00:36:58.002
My mom died.

00:36:58.432 --> 00:37:01.132
My dad is very serious now.

00:37:01.812 --> 00:37:03.792
He is on a ventilator.

00:37:03.832 --> 00:37:05.852
A doctor told me so.

00:37:07.062 --> 00:37:09.462
Ma'am, can you help me?

00:37:12.292 --> 00:37:13.962
I am a young girl.

00:37:14.172 --> 00:37:16.922
No one is telling me the truth.

00:37:17.052 --> 00:37:20.882
They informed me about
my mom's death very late.

00:37:21.422 --> 00:37:24.172
My dad is very serious now.

00:37:24.412 --> 00:37:26.212
I don't know the truth.

00:37:26.502 --> 00:37:30.092
Can you check
and tell me the truth?

00:37:30.232 --> 00:37:32.662
I will bear it,
no matter what it is.

00:37:33.072 --> 00:37:34.082
Please, ma'am.

00:38:04.082 --> 00:38:04.952
Kamal.

00:38:05.252 --> 00:38:06.062
Tell me, Reena.

00:38:06.802 --> 00:38:09.252
You are handling
that girl's case, right?

00:38:09.372 --> 00:38:10.692
Yes, I am.

00:38:11.412 --> 00:38:12.412
How is he?

00:38:12.672 --> 00:38:15.602
He has a severe head injury.

00:38:15.792 --> 00:38:17.092
He is unconscious.

00:38:17.432 --> 00:38:18.792
He has internal bleeding.

00:38:18.932 --> 00:38:20.332
He has multiple blood clots.

00:38:20.452 --> 00:38:23.672
I feel so bad,
we are trying to save him.

00:38:23.732 --> 00:38:25.252
But the chances are low.

00:38:25.402 --> 00:38:27.472
I don't know how to handle this.

00:38:27.682 --> 00:38:29.792
Dr. Kamal, Dr. Vijay called you.

00:38:30.122 --> 00:38:32.382
Krithika's dad is very critical.

00:38:42.192 --> 00:38:43.032
Sir.

00:38:44.502 --> 00:38:45.382
We lost him.

00:38:47.252 --> 00:38:48.792
Note it as brain death.

00:38:49.002 --> 00:38:51.082
Okay, sir.
- Pupils are dilated.

00:38:51.372 --> 00:38:52.512
There is no brain reflex.

00:38:52.962 --> 00:38:54.642
I will inform the authorities.

00:38:54.792 --> 00:38:56.792
Keep him on life support.
We need to keep the organs going.

00:39:10.082 --> 00:39:10.962
Reena.

00:39:12.042 --> 00:39:13.422
Reena..

00:39:14.252 --> 00:39:15.082
Sir.

00:39:16.292 --> 00:39:17.992
I heard about your landlady.

00:39:18.072 --> 00:39:19.062
Is everything okay?

00:39:19.192 --> 00:39:21.752
She is very critical.

00:39:22.042 --> 00:39:22.912
Heart failure.

00:39:23.072 --> 00:39:25.792
We need to do a heart transplant
as soon as possible.

00:39:26.632 --> 00:39:28.212
Sir, I just heard

00:39:28.372 --> 00:39:31.422
that Krithika's dad
was on a ventilator.

00:39:32.122 --> 00:39:33.292
When I went there

00:39:33.962 --> 00:39:35.502
I was told that he is brain-dead.

00:39:36.332 --> 00:39:38.882
If we get his heart,
we can save my aunt, Saradha.

00:39:39.292 --> 00:39:41.042
I checked his files.

00:39:41.582 --> 00:39:42.732
Everything matches.

00:39:43.272 --> 00:39:45.792
By God's grace,
nothing happened to the heart.

00:39:47.582 --> 00:39:50.002
We can swap the organs in the
same hospital without any issues.

00:39:50.052 --> 00:39:52.722
But we need the consent
of his family member.

00:39:53.112 --> 00:39:56.082
The family member
here is a 14-year-old girl.

00:39:56.152 --> 00:39:59.542
I don't know how she is going
to process her mother's death.

00:39:59.772 --> 00:40:01.082
She needs to process that.

00:40:01.212 --> 00:40:03.882
Only after that can we even think
of talking about this transplant.

00:40:04.672 --> 00:40:06.002
Her dad is brain-dead now.

00:40:06.042 --> 00:40:08.212
I don't know how
I am going to tell her that.

00:40:08.492 --> 00:40:09.672
At this time..

00:40:12.132 --> 00:40:14.212
Sir, I-I understand.

00:40:14.622 --> 00:40:16.492
Two lives are in danger here.

00:40:16.672 --> 00:40:19.882
Her dad and Aunt Saradha, sir.

00:40:20.522 --> 00:40:22.792
One person is already brain-dead.

00:40:23.002 --> 00:40:25.632
But we can save the other person.

00:40:25.752 --> 00:40:26.832
Please.
- Reena.

00:40:27.252 --> 00:40:30.582
This is not something
that you and I get to decide.

00:40:30.792 --> 00:40:32.172
There is a protocol for this.

00:40:32.412 --> 00:40:35.742
We need medical clearance. We need
the permission of the attendant.

00:40:36.422 --> 00:40:37.482
The attendant is a minor.

00:40:37.672 --> 00:40:39.002
We need to involve
the medical council.

00:40:39.052 --> 00:40:40.172
We can't rush this.

00:40:41.082 --> 00:40:42.832
Even if there is a chance
of saving her life

00:40:43.562 --> 00:40:45.382
you are asking me to ignore this.

00:40:46.142 --> 00:40:47.582
I am not asking you to ignore this.

00:40:48.172 --> 00:40:50.222
I am just saying we
need to respect the process.

00:40:50.242 --> 00:40:52.292
And we need to respect the dead.

00:42:29.090 --> 00:42:32.720
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:42:34.080 --> 00:42:36.510
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:42.220
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:42:43.880 --> 00:42:46.190
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:42:46.340 --> 00:42:48.780
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:42:48.860 --> 00:42:51.430
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:42:51.510 --> 00:42:54.130
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:42:56.570 --> 00:42:59.340
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:43:01.640 --> 00:43:04.140
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:43:06.280 --> 00:43:10.450
♪ I am also a doctor ♪

00:43:22.190 --> 00:43:23.110
Mr. Arjun.

00:43:23.380 --> 00:43:26.130
We have planned a networking
party for our association.

00:43:26.370 --> 00:43:29.600
We have spoken to almost
all the hospitals regarding that.

00:43:29.670 --> 00:43:31.700
Also, how can we do

00:43:31.790 --> 00:43:34.060
medical networking
in Chennai without RK Hospital?

00:43:34.810 --> 00:43:37.120
So, it will be great
if you refer all the doctors

00:43:37.260 --> 00:43:40.110
in your hospital
to attend this party.

00:43:40.280 --> 00:43:41.250
Think about it.

00:43:41.390 --> 00:43:44.730
If we have a big network of
doctors, it is not only good for us

00:43:44.780 --> 00:43:46.610
but also good for our patients.

00:43:47.070 --> 00:43:48.490
Not only them, Mr. Arjun.

00:43:48.570 --> 00:43:50.270
CEOs like you should also come.

00:43:50.390 --> 00:43:54.000
That party will host
a lot of medical investors

00:43:54.410 --> 00:43:57.530
technological firms and also
showcase new medical equipment's.

00:43:58.200 --> 00:43:59.250
You know it.

00:43:59.750 --> 00:44:03.450
It is not easy for practicing
doctors to attend such parties.

00:44:05.230 --> 00:44:09.020
And they don't even have time
to take care of their personal life.

00:44:09.130 --> 00:44:11.090
That's why I am saying
that this is very important.

00:44:11.230 --> 00:44:14.380
Such gatherings are not
just for gossip and fun.

00:44:14.730 --> 00:44:18.650
Moreover, our doctors who work
without breaks need relaxation.

00:44:18.770 --> 00:44:21.100
And this is not just a relaxation.

00:44:21.180 --> 00:44:23.220
We are considering this
as networking.

00:44:23.940 --> 00:44:25.440
This is not only good
for their career

00:44:25.700 --> 00:44:28.100
but also good
for our medical community.

00:44:28.410 --> 00:44:31.590
Also, this has a lot
of benefits for your hospital.

00:44:32.270 --> 00:44:36.040
Arjun, I was very close to your
father at one point in time.

00:44:36.100 --> 00:44:40.290
I know very well how he developed
this hospital and maintained it.

00:44:40.480 --> 00:44:42.530
Now, this hospital
is in your hands.

00:44:42.920 --> 00:44:47.120
As a well-wisher, I want to do
every good thing to RK Hospital.

00:44:47.240 --> 00:44:48.650
And trust me.

00:44:48.810 --> 00:44:50.590
Through this networking meet

00:44:50.700 --> 00:44:53.230
you can take this
hospital to the next level.

00:44:53.800 --> 00:44:58.130
Collaborations, investments,
new technologies, skill force..

00:44:58.290 --> 00:44:59.720
It has all the potentials.

00:45:02.320 --> 00:45:03.290
Okay.

00:45:03.890 --> 00:45:05.750
I will pass on the invitation
to my doctors.

00:45:05.960 --> 00:45:07.480
Okay, I will see what I can do.

00:45:07.660 --> 00:45:10.220
Thank you, we will expect you
as well, Mr. Arjun.

00:45:10.420 --> 00:45:11.460
Thank you.
- Okay.

00:45:11.560 --> 00:45:12.500
Bye.
- Okay.

00:45:12.680 --> 00:45:13.650
Thanks.

00:45:24.000 --> 00:45:25.130
Ma'am..

00:45:25.400 --> 00:45:27.570
Aunt Saradha's condition
is very bad.

00:45:28.000 --> 00:45:31.920
Based on the situation,
she doesn't have much time.

00:45:32.160 --> 00:45:35.280
Ma'am, I checked
Krithika's father's files.

00:45:35.670 --> 00:45:38.880
Everything, including his age, blood
group and intact heart are perfect.

00:45:39.310 --> 00:45:41.210
Why don't we consider this?

00:45:41.440 --> 00:45:42.280
No.

00:45:42.320 --> 00:45:43.750
This is not the right time, Reena.

00:45:44.070 --> 00:45:45.280
I don't understand, ma'am.

00:45:45.520 --> 00:45:46.830
He is brain-dead.

00:45:47.040 --> 00:45:48.500
But he has a functional heart.

00:45:48.720 --> 00:45:50.600
We can save my aunt
with that heart.

00:45:51.860 --> 00:45:53.930
Do you understand what
you are saying, Reena?

00:45:54.690 --> 00:45:56.360
Is the heart a remote battery?

00:45:56.880 --> 00:45:58.490
To replace one with another?

00:45:59.030 --> 00:46:01.280
Okay, even if we can do that

00:46:02.030 --> 00:46:05.850
there are many procedures and tests
to be taken to see if it matches.

00:46:06.790 --> 00:46:09.400
And above all, we have
to get consent from that girl.

00:46:09.750 --> 00:46:10.830
Do you remember?

00:46:11.590 --> 00:46:14.090
And Vijay and I
have to assess that.

00:46:14.720 --> 00:46:16.290
Priority, protocols..

00:46:16.360 --> 00:46:18.910
Ma'am, I understand
what you are saying.

00:46:19.770 --> 00:46:22.130
But I feel like
we are doing nothing.

00:46:22.780 --> 00:46:25.410
Reena, you are looking
at this case very personally.

00:46:27.600 --> 00:46:28.560
Not as a doctor.

00:46:29.200 --> 00:46:30.720
But as a family member.

00:46:32.100 --> 00:46:35.200
Reena, I am saying this
for your and Saradha's good.

00:46:36.190 --> 00:46:37.880
Henceforth, don't get
involved in this case.

00:46:38.030 --> 00:46:38.990
Do you understand?

00:46:41.080 --> 00:46:42.530
Rocky and Teju will handle it.

00:46:44.530 --> 00:46:45.480
Ma'am.

00:46:59.380 --> 00:47:00.970
Are you really siblings?

00:47:01.840 --> 00:47:04.240
I mean, I don't see
any similarity between you two.

00:47:04.310 --> 00:47:06.050
That's why I asked.
- It's nothing.

00:47:06.150 --> 00:47:08.380
He looks like our father.
I look like our mother.

00:47:08.430 --> 00:47:09.280
Is it?

00:47:09.370 --> 00:47:10.780
What is your name?
- Sinduja.

00:47:10.850 --> 00:47:11.960
They call me Sindu.

00:47:12.370 --> 00:47:13.220
Sindu.

00:47:13.350 --> 00:47:14.960
Nice name. What do you do?

00:47:14.990 --> 00:47:16.590
I am in the final year of MBBS.

00:47:16.740 --> 00:47:17.860
You are also a medical student?

00:47:17.930 --> 00:47:19.920
Superb then, finish your
studies and come here.

00:47:19.980 --> 00:47:22.140
You can use
Kiran's influence and join here.

00:47:22.250 --> 00:47:23.900
I don't want to do that.

00:47:25.310 --> 00:47:26.820
What?
- Ask her.

00:47:27.040 --> 00:47:27.950
You ask her.

00:47:28.750 --> 00:47:30.010
Why don't you join as an intern?

00:47:30.210 --> 00:47:31.730
What other plans do you have?

00:47:31.810 --> 00:47:34.160
I want to get married
and be a good housewife.

00:47:36.110 --> 00:47:39.140
Hey, you said it
like a big problem.

00:47:39.610 --> 00:47:42.140
Her biggest wish is to get
married and settle down.

00:47:42.200 --> 00:47:43.330
In this generation

00:47:43.470 --> 00:47:46.130
those who want to get married
and settle down are rare to see.

00:47:46.500 --> 00:47:48.690
Like your father said,
let her get married first.

00:47:48.770 --> 00:47:50.530
Then we can do it.

00:47:50.640 --> 00:47:51.980
Thank you, sister.
- You are superb.

00:47:52.080 --> 00:47:54.550
Nilofer, don't decide based on this.

00:47:55.220 --> 00:47:57.570
Sindu, what kind
of a husband do you want?

00:47:57.630 --> 00:47:58.760
Tell me, let's hear it.

00:47:59.480 --> 00:48:00.330
It's nothing.

00:48:00.450 --> 00:48:02.830
I don't have any big expectations.
He just has to be a graduate.

00:48:03.490 --> 00:48:04.540
That's fair, okay.

00:48:04.700 --> 00:48:07.110
It doesn't have to be
a PG, UG is enough.

00:48:07.320 --> 00:48:09.840
If they are over-educated,
they will control us unnecessarily.

00:48:10.320 --> 00:48:12.030
Okay, let's see.
- Yeah.

00:48:12.370 --> 00:48:14.190
After that, I just want a house.

00:48:14.270 --> 00:48:16.600
With 1200 sq. ft,
a two-story house.

00:48:17.380 --> 00:48:18.340
That's okay, right?

00:48:19.090 --> 00:48:20.200
That's okay, right?

00:48:21.050 --> 00:48:23.630
I don't want him
to earn too much or too little.

00:48:23.760 --> 00:48:26.150
Just Rs. 2 lakhs should be enough
to handle things.

00:48:28.190 --> 00:48:29.110
Okay.

00:48:29.810 --> 00:48:32.500
Also, he shouldn't have a mother.

00:48:35.260 --> 00:48:36.170
Okay.

00:48:36.340 --> 00:48:37.390
If he has a mother, let it be.

00:48:37.650 --> 00:48:40.050
But after marriage,
he should live separately with me.

00:48:40.620 --> 00:48:41.970
Do I have to say okay to this?

00:48:43.420 --> 00:48:44.640
Tell me, what else?

00:48:44.810 --> 00:48:47.860
After that, as usual.
He shouldn't drink or smoke.

00:48:47.960 --> 00:48:49.410
He should be a calm boy.

00:48:49.480 --> 00:48:51.770
Even if I hit him in anger,
he should accept it.

00:48:52.870 --> 00:48:53.780
Hey.

00:48:54.270 --> 00:48:55.210
What is this?

00:48:55.430 --> 00:48:57.430
Listen, there is more.

00:48:58.810 --> 00:49:00.970
This is a very important condition.

00:49:01.070 --> 00:49:02.890
He should definitely be a virgin.

00:49:06.600 --> 00:49:07.510
Hey.

00:49:07.840 --> 00:49:09.010
What is all this?

00:49:11.750 --> 00:49:13.120
Is she really your sister?

00:49:13.150 --> 00:49:15.540
Or did you set her up to avoid me?
- Hey.

00:49:15.690 --> 00:49:16.680
It's not like that.

00:49:16.870 --> 00:49:18.010
She is my blood.

00:49:18.090 --> 00:49:19.130
I might say something bad.

00:49:19.350 --> 00:49:20.980
Where will I find a guy like this?

00:49:21.770 --> 00:49:23.320
I said okay without
knowing this beforehand.

00:49:23.400 --> 00:49:25.600
Do you realise
why I was so scared that day?

00:49:25.670 --> 00:49:26.660
Hey.

00:49:27.030 --> 00:49:28.120
I can see clearly

00:49:28.260 --> 00:49:31.190
why your father wants
her to get married first.

00:49:31.600 --> 00:49:32.900
I can see it very clearly.

00:49:33.640 --> 00:49:35.480
This might be a big task.

00:49:35.660 --> 00:49:36.800
I don't think it will happen.

00:49:37.880 --> 00:49:39.670
Don't bring this to me.
- Nilofer.

00:49:39.820 --> 00:49:40.750
Please.

00:49:40.840 --> 00:49:42.530
Didn't you say
that you would take care of it?

00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:43.910
Yes, I did. So what?

00:49:45.300 --> 00:49:46.640
Hey, leave me.

00:49:46.720 --> 00:49:48.440
I will ask my father
to find me a good guy

00:49:48.590 --> 00:49:50.000
without a sister

00:49:50.050 --> 00:49:51.540
and I'll get married to him.

00:49:51.630 --> 00:49:53.100
I can't stand this.
- Nilofer!

00:49:53.290 --> 00:49:55.290
Nilofer..

00:49:55.390 --> 00:49:56.640
Please help me.

00:49:58.020 --> 00:49:59.300
Don't look at me like that.

00:50:00.280 --> 00:50:01.180
Help me.

00:50:02.670 --> 00:50:04.240
It's difficult for me to leave you.

00:50:05.530 --> 00:50:06.720
Did you finish the list?

00:50:07.590 --> 00:50:08.540
Okay.

00:50:08.660 --> 00:50:09.850
Be quiet from now on.

00:50:11.240 --> 00:50:12.900
I will do it.
- Thank you, sister.

00:50:27.550 --> 00:50:28.410
Uncle.

00:50:30.880 --> 00:50:33.540
I spoke to Dr. Radhi
about the transplant.

00:50:34.360 --> 00:50:36.010
She said she will take care of it.

00:50:36.390 --> 00:50:37.400
Reena.

00:50:40.750 --> 00:50:44.980
It used to be a problem
that we don't have kids.

00:50:46.230 --> 00:50:48.510
But we didn't take it seriously.
Do you know why?

00:50:48.920 --> 00:50:51.580
When I am there for her
and she is there for me

00:50:52.620 --> 00:50:54.010
it was not big a deal.

00:50:55.250 --> 00:50:56.350
But yesterday..

00:50:57.680 --> 00:51:01.350
When I saw her unconscious,
I was terrified.

00:51:02.710 --> 00:51:05.440
Nothing will happen to her.
- What will I do, Reena?

00:51:06.090 --> 00:51:07.920
I don't have anyone to talk to.

00:51:08.720 --> 00:51:10.490
How will I live alone?

00:51:14.080 --> 00:51:15.070
For me..

00:51:16.400 --> 00:51:18.230
When I hear her snoring,

00:51:18.680 --> 00:51:20.030
even if it disturbs me

00:51:20.970 --> 00:51:24.060
I got used to it with time.

00:51:25.570 --> 00:51:27.300
Now I can't sleep
without the sound of her snoring.

00:51:29.300 --> 00:51:30.290
Saradha.

00:51:53.590 --> 00:51:55.420
Check if everything is fine.

00:51:56.260 --> 00:51:57.210
Manasa.

00:51:59.060 --> 00:52:01.620
Tell me, Arjun.
- I know you are hurt.

00:52:02.050 --> 00:52:03.100
I am sorry for that.

00:52:14.910 --> 00:52:15.750
Arjun.

00:52:15.980 --> 00:52:18.280
You're saying sorry to me
over such minor things.

00:52:19.100 --> 00:52:20.890
I said what I felt.

00:52:21.260 --> 00:52:23.900
You said what you felt honestly.

00:52:24.140 --> 00:52:25.110
That's all, right?

00:52:28.680 --> 00:52:30.790
In fact, many people
don't do this, Arjun.

00:52:32.760 --> 00:52:34.480
And what you said is also right.

00:52:35.270 --> 00:52:36.940
You love Reena.

00:52:39.650 --> 00:52:41.810
It's really my fault..

00:52:42.660 --> 00:52:43.730
Okay, leave it.

00:52:44.220 --> 00:52:45.680
Did you come to talk about this?

00:52:46.650 --> 00:52:47.700
No.
- Then?

00:52:47.860 --> 00:52:49.930
A party is being organised
from our medical council.

00:52:50.730 --> 00:52:52.890
Important doctors have been
invited from our hospital.

00:52:53.900 --> 00:52:54.870
Oh.

00:52:55.050 --> 00:52:56.420
Only important doctors?

00:52:57.100 --> 00:52:57.960
Yes.

00:52:58.340 --> 00:53:00.600
That's why I came
to invite you in person.

00:53:01.430 --> 00:53:04.210
And because of what
happened that day, our friendship

00:53:04.690 --> 00:53:06.760
or mutual respect shouldn't suffer.

00:53:07.750 --> 00:53:08.940
I hope you understand.

00:53:10.340 --> 00:53:11.370
Yeah, Arjun.

00:53:39.260 --> 00:53:41.430
No spontaneous movement.
No reflex.

00:53:42.040 --> 00:53:43.170
Completely ventilated.

00:53:43.240 --> 00:53:44.510
Confirmed brain death.

00:53:45.000 --> 00:53:47.500
Organs are still functional
but completely machine dependent.

00:53:48.120 --> 00:53:49.340
Organs are still perfused.

00:53:49.500 --> 00:53:50.590
Brain, liver, heart.

00:53:51.390 --> 00:53:54.630
His name is not
on the donor registration list.

00:53:54.970 --> 00:53:56.990
We checked his ID and his number.

00:53:57.390 --> 00:53:58.740
There is no declaration.

00:53:59.220 --> 00:54:00.810
There is no adult attender either.

00:54:01.220 --> 00:54:02.250
Without consent

00:54:02.930 --> 00:54:05.320
we can't touch
even one of his organs.

00:54:06.000 --> 00:54:09.710
I don't even know if his heart
is compatible with Saradha's.

00:54:10.100 --> 00:54:12.490
But yes, as Reena said,
their blood matches.

00:54:12.680 --> 00:54:15.390
But I've asked Rocky
to do a cross-match.

00:54:16.150 --> 00:54:17.930
Let us get that report.

00:54:18.200 --> 00:54:19.700
We'll decide
what to do based on that.

00:54:56.820 --> 00:54:59.110
Rocky, what about the reports?
- Ma'am, their blood group

00:54:59.150 --> 00:55:00.820
is the same.
I've done the cross-matching.

00:55:01.100 --> 00:55:03.000
Everything should be
correct, we can proceed.

00:55:03.700 --> 00:55:05.320
It's not that easy to proceed.

00:55:05.990 --> 00:55:07.540
There will be
administration problems.

00:55:07.750 --> 00:55:09.460
The attendant here is a minor.

00:55:09.840 --> 00:55:12.440
What if there is a problem in the future
after getting her consent now?

00:55:14.220 --> 00:55:15.270
Medical council?

00:55:16.250 --> 00:55:17.440
We have to involve them.

00:55:17.630 --> 00:55:19.470
But it'll take
4-5 days for them to get involved.

00:55:19.680 --> 00:55:21.330
Review, consent, ethics approval..

00:55:22.050 --> 00:55:23.620
We don't even have enough time.

00:55:26.390 --> 00:55:27.790
This won't work if we just talk.

00:55:28.060 --> 00:55:30.580
I'll send them a detailed email.

00:55:30.970 --> 00:55:32.620
I'll ask for a special
concession to fast track it.

00:55:33.520 --> 00:55:35.530
This is the only option
that she has.

00:56:01.940 --> 00:56:02.850
Reena.

00:56:08.050 --> 00:56:09.060
Reena.

00:56:16.690 --> 00:56:17.710
It's okay.

00:56:18.650 --> 00:56:19.580
It's okay.

00:56:20.470 --> 00:56:21.560
Nothing will happen.

00:56:24.450 --> 00:56:27.330
Dr. Radhi and Dr. Vijay are
still talking about the transplant.

00:56:28.180 --> 00:56:29.310
You be brave.

00:56:33.750 --> 00:56:36.210
We don't have enough time.

00:56:36.790 --> 00:56:38.430
It's getting late.

00:56:39.930 --> 00:56:40.890
Reena.

00:56:41.720 --> 00:56:42.660
Look at me.

00:56:43.720 --> 00:56:45.030
Reena, look at me.

00:56:48.290 --> 00:56:49.290
You know it.

00:56:49.770 --> 00:56:52.320
Dr. Radhi and Dr. Vijay
are the best doctors in the city.

00:56:52.600 --> 00:56:53.950
They haven't given up yet.

00:56:55.180 --> 00:56:56.560
Nothing will happen to her.

00:57:02.160 --> 00:57:03.190
Be brave.

00:57:04.490 --> 00:57:05.520
Arjun.

00:57:05.970 --> 00:57:10.080
I can't lose her, Arjun.

00:57:15.220 --> 00:57:16.640
Let's believe that
nothing will happen.

00:57:19.220 --> 00:57:49.220
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

00:57:20.820 --> 00:57:21.850
Reena.

00:57:24.430 --> 00:57:25.970
Dr. Radhi and Dr. Vijay
have called for you.

00:57:31.350 --> 00:57:32.460
You go, I'll come.

00:57:41.340 --> 00:57:42.180
Ma'am.

00:57:45.270 --> 00:57:48.330
Reena, we had sent an email
to the council and they've replied.

00:57:48.700 --> 00:57:49.800
That's why we called you.

00:57:50.580 --> 00:57:52.690
I had mailed the details
to the medical council.

00:57:52.870 --> 00:57:54.020
Brain-dead donor.

00:57:54.250 --> 00:57:55.770
Patient needs heart transplant.

00:57:56.550 --> 00:57:59.140
I had asked for a special
permission to accelerate it.

00:57:59.180 --> 00:58:01.440
But..
- We can do it right away, right?

00:58:02.300 --> 00:58:06.140
No, they too have
a list of protocols.

00:58:07.070 --> 00:58:09.510
But this isn't like
the usual cases.

00:58:09.600 --> 00:58:14.450
They'll send a team directly and
verify her urgency and legitimacy.

00:58:15.050 --> 00:58:19.300
But before that, we need to get
consent from the patient's family.

00:58:19.770 --> 00:58:21.620
There's no one here
from the patient's family.

00:58:21.940 --> 00:58:24.340
No one even came to see
that little girl, Krithika, ma'am.

00:58:24.490 --> 00:58:26.300
Then, who will come
to sign the consent form?

00:58:27.450 --> 00:58:29.450
Then we need to get
consent from Krithika.

00:58:29.930 --> 00:58:32.080
Ma'am, she's a little girl.

00:58:32.620 --> 00:58:36.240
How can we ask her
to donate her father's heart?

00:58:37.370 --> 00:58:39.020
Now, it's the only way.

00:58:39.340 --> 00:58:40.750
But even if we ask her

00:58:41.090 --> 00:58:45.370
the medical council will need
to verify it before approval.

00:58:45.760 --> 00:58:47.850
There's no point
in pressurising them now

00:58:47.890 --> 00:58:49.760
because we can't move
forward immediately.

00:59:11.450 --> 00:59:12.430
Krithika.

00:59:15.680 --> 00:59:19.980
Did the doctor say
that your father is brain dead?

00:59:26.710 --> 00:59:28.800
I can understand
your pain, Krithika.

00:59:31.300 --> 00:59:32.370
At least for me..

00:59:32.850 --> 00:59:34.540
I didn't have
my parents since childhood.

00:59:35.770 --> 00:59:37.200
But that's not the case for you.

00:59:38.100 --> 00:59:39.940
You had your parents
for so many years.

00:59:41.260 --> 00:59:42.790
But now that they are gone

00:59:43.640 --> 00:59:45.860
I can understand
how much pain you're in.

00:59:49.720 --> 00:59:51.500
We don't have any other choice.

00:59:53.490 --> 00:59:55.410
You need to move on from this.

00:59:58.220 --> 01:00:00.530
Why are you telling me all this?

01:00:07.050 --> 01:00:09.110
I need your help.

01:00:11.470 --> 01:00:13.340
I'm not in a position to help.

01:00:14.640 --> 01:00:15.990
No, Krithika.

01:00:17.720 --> 01:00:19.530
You're the only one
who can help me.

01:00:29.550 --> 01:00:31.480
Your father is brain dead.

01:00:31.840 --> 01:00:36.760
But we can save many
people with his organs.

01:00:39.680 --> 01:00:43.190
An important person in my life..

01:00:45.730 --> 01:00:47.670
My landlady..

01:00:49.100 --> 01:00:51.660
She has heart failure, Krithika.

01:00:52.550 --> 01:00:54.760
You can save her.

01:00:56.710 --> 01:00:58.270
You can help her.

01:01:02.560 --> 01:01:03.730
I can't.

01:01:04.300 --> 01:01:07.030
I can't donate
my father's heart to anyone.

01:01:07.260 --> 01:01:08.680
I won't give it.

01:01:09.220 --> 01:01:10.060
I won't.

01:01:10.780 --> 01:01:12.950
I can't give away
my father's heart.

01:02:27.894 --> 01:02:31.524
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:02:32.884 --> 01:02:35.314
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:02:37.964 --> 01:02:41.024
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:02:42.684 --> 01:02:44.994
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:02:45.144 --> 01:02:47.584
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:02:47.664 --> 01:02:50.234
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:02:50.314 --> 01:02:52.934
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:02:55.374 --> 01:02:58.144
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:03:00.444 --> 01:03:02.944
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:03:04.914 --> 01:03:09.234
♪ I am also a doctor ♪

01:03:21.144 --> 01:03:23.734
I called you yesterday.
Why didn't you pick up?

01:03:25.644 --> 01:03:27.454
Is it a problem
that I didn't answer your call?

01:03:28.434 --> 01:03:30.564
But you've never answered
any of my calls.

01:03:30.894 --> 01:03:32.514
You even block me often.

01:03:33.104 --> 01:03:35.354
So, you didn't answer
because you wanted to take revenge?

01:03:35.514 --> 01:03:36.354
Isn't it?

01:03:36.614 --> 01:03:37.404
Ego.

01:03:38.274 --> 01:03:39.634
It's not about ego, Charu.

01:03:40.084 --> 01:03:42.234
There is an important case
going on in the hospital.

01:03:42.784 --> 01:03:45.364
You always call me
when I am working.

01:03:45.414 --> 01:03:47.694
Do you expect me to ignore
my work and be on calls with you?

01:03:47.784 --> 01:03:48.984
I didn't say that.

01:03:49.204 --> 01:03:53.534
In the name of treating patients,
you'd be flirting with girls.

01:03:53.624 --> 01:03:55.044
That's why
you didn't answer my call.

01:03:55.354 --> 01:03:56.574
What do you think about me?

01:03:56.864 --> 01:03:59.604
Do you think that I flirt with all
the girls when you're not around?

01:04:02.804 --> 01:04:04.944
I mentioned
an important case, right?

01:04:05.554 --> 01:04:06.814
It is Mrs. Saradha.

01:04:07.104 --> 01:04:08.144
She has heart failure.

01:04:08.524 --> 01:04:09.474
She needs a transplant.

01:04:10.474 --> 01:04:12.204
I am handling that case now.

01:04:12.494 --> 01:04:13.374
I knew it.

01:04:13.844 --> 01:04:16.984
Reena and her landlady
are important to you.

01:04:17.234 --> 01:04:18.354
But I am not important to you.

01:04:19.484 --> 01:04:21.704
What are you even talking about?

01:04:21.944 --> 01:04:24.854
She is fighting for her life
but you are talking about yourself.

01:04:26.454 --> 01:04:28.864
I have told you
many things about Mrs. Saradha.

01:04:29.184 --> 01:04:31.634
Don't talk like this.
- Why are you getting angry?

01:04:32.204 --> 01:04:34.624
I should be angry
that you are not answering my call.

01:04:35.994 --> 01:04:38.744
Charu, I can't explain it
to you again and again.

01:04:38.884 --> 01:04:41.154
I can't fight with you
for no reason.

01:04:47.434 --> 01:04:51.944
I am always trying to prove to you
that I am a good person.

01:04:52.104 --> 01:04:55.234
Maybe that is
the mistake I am making.

01:04:56.274 --> 01:04:57.174
Look here, Charu.

01:04:58.224 --> 01:05:01.904
The relationship will work only
if we have trust in each other.

01:05:04.074 --> 01:05:06.574
I am trying to prove to you
that I am a good person

01:05:06.634 --> 01:05:08.024
but it is not working.

01:05:10.914 --> 01:05:13.674
But one thing is clear to me now.

01:05:13.934 --> 01:05:17.194
You are never going to believe me.

01:05:18.464 --> 01:05:19.844
I have a lot of work.

01:05:20.364 --> 01:05:21.304
I am leaving.

01:05:25.804 --> 01:05:28.614
One more important thing.

01:05:29.344 --> 01:05:30.254
Yes.

01:05:31.394 --> 01:05:33.054
Reena is very important to me.

01:05:51.474 --> 01:05:52.284
Teju.

01:05:53.624 --> 01:05:58.234
That girl told me that she
can't give away her father's heart.

01:05:59.424 --> 01:06:01.234
I don't know what to do.

01:06:06.264 --> 01:06:07.784
Have the council members arrived?

01:06:08.244 --> 01:06:09.084
I don't know.

01:06:09.544 --> 01:06:12.234
I came here
to avoid thinking about it.

01:06:17.994 --> 01:06:22.314
Before the council members
come, let me talk to her once.

01:06:23.194 --> 01:06:25.324
There is a chance that
she might change her mind.

01:06:26.124 --> 01:06:27.024
No, Teju.

01:06:27.904 --> 01:06:30.254
Think about the girl's situation.

01:06:32.164 --> 01:06:34.104
We shouldn't pressure her.

01:06:36.254 --> 01:06:38.604
I shouldn't have asked her.

01:06:40.254 --> 01:06:44.314
But I couldn't bear
to see my aunt like this.

01:06:44.644 --> 01:06:46.444
That's why I asked her.

01:06:48.424 --> 01:06:51.484
We only think
about our own situation.

01:06:51.684 --> 01:06:52.884
But this girl..

01:06:54.434 --> 01:06:56.654
Look at her situation.

01:06:57.854 --> 01:07:01.444
Do you know how much she suffered
when I asked for her dad's heart?

01:07:03.984 --> 01:07:06.154
I can understand her pain.

01:07:08.424 --> 01:07:09.194
Reena.

01:07:09.994 --> 01:07:12.024
Krithika is removing her father
from the ventilator.

01:07:12.614 --> 01:07:13.984
What are you saying?
- Yes.

01:07:14.084 --> 01:07:16.654
She told the council members that
she won't donate her dad's heart.

01:07:16.804 --> 01:07:17.804
They told her that he won't wake up

01:07:17.964 --> 01:07:19.774
and that he is alive
only because of the ventilator.

01:07:20.084 --> 01:07:21.484
Then she asked me
to remove him from the ventilator.

01:07:46.654 --> 01:07:47.554
Dad..

01:07:52.904 --> 01:07:53.774
Mom..

01:08:11.554 --> 01:08:13.064
Wait a minute.

01:08:26.814 --> 01:08:31.064
Can we save your landlady
with my dad's heart?

01:09:02.464 --> 01:09:03.314
Dr. Reena.

01:09:06.564 --> 01:09:08.154
Patient Saradha is dead.

01:10:56.244 --> 01:10:58.694
Uncle..

01:11:22.514 --> 01:11:24.024
Rocky..

01:12:26.114 --> 01:12:28.024
Aunty..

01:12:55.464 --> 01:12:59.734
Mr. Ganesh retired early to spend
more time with Mrs. Saradha.

01:13:01.054 --> 01:13:03.814
I don't know how he will cope
with such a big loss.

01:13:04.764 --> 01:13:06.864
She was like a family to us.

01:13:14.834 --> 01:13:17.294
Life is so unfair, dude.

01:13:18.904 --> 01:13:19.744
Yes.

01:13:21.024 --> 01:13:22.814
It's very difficult to see Reena.

01:15:10.974 --> 01:15:12.404
It's getting late, shall we start?

01:15:18.724 --> 01:15:21.134
Oh, God..

01:15:27.064 --> 01:15:29.864
Reena, shall I ask
Teju to stay here?

01:15:31.494 --> 01:15:32.974
It's okay with me, I'll stay here.

01:15:35.164 --> 01:15:36.524
No, Arjun, don't.

01:15:37.874 --> 01:15:39.014
No, Teju.

01:15:39.504 --> 01:15:41.444
I'll take care.
You guys leave.

01:15:45.094 --> 01:15:45.904
Okay.

01:15:47.674 --> 01:15:49.234
Don't cry.
Take care.

01:15:50.724 --> 01:15:51.904
Okay.
Take care, Reena.

01:16:20.794 --> 01:16:24.024
I can't even imagine
a life without Saradha.

01:16:25.714 --> 01:16:30.444
She was with me for 38 years.
How could she die before me?

01:16:30.764 --> 01:16:32.724
I can't bear it.

01:16:34.184 --> 01:16:35.804
Uncle..

01:16:36.644 --> 01:16:40.694
Do you remember how I was when
I had recently moved to Chennai?

01:16:41.224 --> 01:16:44.064
I wasn't afraid
of anything at that time.

01:16:46.064 --> 01:16:49.964
Because if anything happens to me,
it would've been over with me.

01:16:50.694 --> 01:16:53.774
I didn't have a family
to worry about me.

01:16:55.074 --> 01:16:58.924
Just then
I found you and your wife.

01:17:02.004 --> 01:17:05.554
If anything happens to me,
you both will suffer.

01:17:08.574 --> 01:17:09.994
I am also the same.

01:17:11.214 --> 01:17:13.474
I wanted you both to be happy.

01:17:13.884 --> 01:17:17.044
I wanted you both to be with me.

01:17:18.024 --> 01:17:48.024
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

01:17:22.614 --> 01:17:28.734
I don't know how I would have
handled this without you both.

01:17:31.984 --> 01:17:33.844
Don't feel bad, Uncle.

01:17:36.994 --> 01:17:39.944
Aunt Saradha
will always be with us.

01:17:40.784 --> 01:17:41.904
I'll be there.

01:17:42.954 --> 01:17:44.524
I'll always be with you.

01:17:45.704 --> 01:17:46.774
Oh, God..

01:17:48.834 --> 01:17:53.654
I don't care if it is my mother,
brother, grandfather or sister.

01:17:55.634 --> 01:17:58.904
You both accepted me first.

01:17:59.474 --> 01:18:01.094
You are my first family.

01:18:02.854 --> 01:18:05.054
I'll always
take care of you, Uncle.

01:18:26.084 --> 01:18:27.984
Life is so unpredictable, Teju.

01:18:29.884 --> 01:18:36.064
If someone had told me this two days
ago, I wouldn't have believed it.

01:18:39.564 --> 01:18:43.774
No one cares about
what is happening now.

01:18:44.434 --> 01:18:47.644
They keep postponing everything.

01:18:47.724 --> 01:18:49.744
Tomorrow is not guaranteed, Teju.

01:18:50.314 --> 01:18:54.154
Don't you have the habit
of talking clearly?

01:18:55.234 --> 01:18:57.444
You always talk in riddles.

01:18:58.654 --> 01:19:00.904
I am talking about us, Teju.

01:19:01.954 --> 01:19:03.484
You say that you like me.

01:19:03.754 --> 01:19:07.614
But you don't think about
the present, in fear of the future.

01:19:07.914 --> 01:19:10.194
Tomorrow is not guaranteed, Teju.

01:19:10.414 --> 01:19:12.034
Please understand..
- I don't care.

01:19:12.434 --> 01:19:14.904
I don't care
if there is no tomorrow.

01:19:16.754 --> 01:19:18.114
Oh, God..

01:19:18.674 --> 01:19:22.274
You know that I love you, right?

01:19:23.144 --> 01:19:25.694
I am waiting to hear it from you.

01:19:26.014 --> 01:19:26.734
You..

01:19:27.774 --> 01:19:28.754
What is wrong with you?

01:19:29.404 --> 01:19:31.694
You are always talking about love.

01:19:32.074 --> 01:19:33.044
Teju..

01:19:33.734 --> 01:19:35.534
You said you wanted to wait.

01:19:35.774 --> 01:19:37.074
Did I ask you to wait?

01:19:37.364 --> 01:19:38.984
Did I ask you to wait?

01:19:41.244 --> 01:19:44.314
I mean.. You didn't ask me to wait.

01:19:44.764 --> 01:19:48.194
But it felt like you asked me
to wait, indirectly.

01:19:48.624 --> 01:19:50.524
What are you searching for, Teju?
- You..

01:19:52.424 --> 01:19:53.524
Hey..
- Hey!

01:19:53.584 --> 01:19:55.294
Wait..
- Did I ask you to wait?

01:19:55.344 --> 01:19:57.664
No..
- Did I ask you..

01:19:57.714 --> 01:19:58.664
Put it down..

01:20:00.024 --> 01:20:03.404
Thank God,
she didn't break my head.

01:20:08.704 --> 01:20:09.844
T-Teju..

01:20:12.444 --> 01:20:14.064
To me, love is..

01:20:16.524 --> 01:20:21.114
It's not about having coffee
with someone or watching a movie.

01:20:21.864 --> 01:20:23.684
There are many things beyond that.

01:20:24.104 --> 01:20:25.444
You won't understand.

01:20:27.954 --> 01:20:29.294
Beyond that?

01:20:31.254 --> 01:20:35.444
I can't love you
just because I like you.

01:20:36.594 --> 01:20:38.314
I need to trust you.

01:20:40.094 --> 01:20:44.184
We both need to trust that you
and I will be there for each other

01:20:44.234 --> 01:20:45.864
no matter the situation.

01:20:47.514 --> 01:20:50.364
I will always trust you, Teju.

01:20:51.274 --> 01:20:53.984
But I don't trust you.
- Why?

01:20:54.314 --> 01:20:55.944
I will tell you
when I get that trust.

01:20:58.904 --> 01:20:59.784
Teju..

01:20:59.844 --> 01:21:01.484
Should I wait or not?

01:21:05.864 --> 01:21:07.424
You don't need to do anything.

01:21:08.784 --> 01:21:10.124
Go and die.

01:21:13.084 --> 01:21:13.964
Wait..

01:21:15.874 --> 01:21:17.534
Let's die together.
Let's go.

01:21:34.694 --> 01:21:36.614
How long should we continue this?

01:21:58.504 --> 01:21:59.324
Sir..

01:22:00.004 --> 01:22:00.994
Can I ask you something?

01:22:01.784 --> 01:22:02.624
Sure.

01:22:08.194 --> 01:22:11.734
I think your question will be
more suspenseful than my answer.

01:22:12.314 --> 01:22:13.254
Ask me, Arjun.

01:22:13.904 --> 01:22:16.404
You said you wanted to work here
after finishing the athletes' case.

01:22:19.234 --> 01:22:22.064
You said that working in RK Hospital
will give you peace of mind.

01:22:25.484 --> 01:22:28.024
I don't think
that's the only reason.

01:22:29.704 --> 01:22:30.524
Oh..

01:22:30.954 --> 01:22:32.944
What else
do you think is the reason?

01:22:40.274 --> 01:22:41.314
I don't know, sir.

01:22:42.754 --> 01:22:43.684
But..

01:22:44.884 --> 01:22:46.244
There is something else.

01:22:47.174 --> 01:22:48.724
I know that you are trying
to ask me something.

01:22:49.514 --> 01:22:50.994
You can ask me directly, Arjun.

01:22:52.184 --> 01:22:54.184
I have a lot of questions
to ask you, sir.

01:22:58.234 --> 01:23:00.654
You said that you met Dr. Radhi
at a conference, right?

01:23:00.854 --> 01:23:03.614
But I think
you knew her way before that.

01:23:09.324 --> 01:23:11.204
All your questions
have the same answer.

01:23:13.564 --> 01:23:15.014
I will tell you one thing.

01:23:15.744 --> 01:23:16.874
But let it be between us.

01:23:18.624 --> 01:23:19.444
Tell me, sir.

01:23:20.624 --> 01:23:21.464
Yeah, you are right.

01:23:22.714 --> 01:23:24.254
I didn't come here for work.

01:23:26.384 --> 01:23:27.774
I came here..

01:23:29.924 --> 01:23:30.974
For Radhi.

01:23:34.514 --> 01:23:35.734
Radhi is my ex.

01:23:38.024 --> 01:23:39.284
What do you mean by ex?

01:23:40.104 --> 01:23:41.244
In college?

01:23:42.274 --> 01:23:43.074
No.

01:23:44.784 --> 01:23:45.664
Even before that.

01:23:45.784 --> 01:23:46.704
Back in school.

01:25:11.074 --> 01:25:14.074
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:25:16.124 --> 01:25:18.514
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:25:21.154 --> 01:25:23.974
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:25:25.844 --> 01:25:28.224
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:25:28.324 --> 01:25:30.774
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:25:30.884 --> 01:25:33.484
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:25:33.684 --> 01:25:36.094
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:25:38.504 --> 01:25:41.214
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:25:43.604 --> 01:25:46.214
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:25:48.244 --> 01:25:53.124
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:26:11.604 --> 01:26:13.614
Uncle, I would have
made it for you.

01:26:13.794 --> 01:26:15.004
Why are you doing it?

01:26:15.094 --> 01:26:17.494
It's okay, it's not a big deal.

01:26:17.664 --> 01:26:20.604
Uncle, you sit.
I will make the dosa.

01:26:20.724 --> 01:26:22.744
It's okay, you eat.
You're getting late.

01:26:22.804 --> 01:26:24.094
You have to go to the hospital.

01:26:24.724 --> 01:26:27.854
No, Uncle.
I want to take a few days off.

01:26:27.924 --> 01:26:28.784
Off?

01:26:30.624 --> 01:26:31.734
Why, dear?

01:26:32.644 --> 01:26:34.754
You will be all alone.

01:26:35.364 --> 01:26:38.324
I will take a few days off
until you get a caretaker.

01:26:39.544 --> 01:26:41.944
No need, dear.
You go to the hospital first.

01:26:42.204 --> 01:26:44.304
You listen to me and sit down now.

01:26:51.494 --> 01:26:52.404
Reena.

01:26:53.204 --> 01:26:54.974
When you came to this house
for the first time

01:26:56.484 --> 01:26:58.504
Saradha used to say this often.

01:27:00.494 --> 01:27:02.994
She used to say that
she will take care of you.

01:27:03.044 --> 01:27:06.454
That's why she didn't
ask you to do anything.

01:27:07.574 --> 01:27:09.154
I won't say anything either.

01:27:18.464 --> 01:27:19.904
Even though Saradha isn't here

01:27:20.764 --> 01:27:24.284
I will take care of you
as long as I am alive.

01:27:25.044 --> 01:27:27.044
You took the words
right out of my mouth.

01:27:27.774 --> 01:27:31.204
You're getting late for work.
You eat and leave, please.

01:27:31.684 --> 01:27:32.744
You carry on.

01:27:37.714 --> 01:27:39.514
Sir, one tea.

01:27:39.844 --> 01:27:40.814
Hi, Kamal.

01:27:42.944 --> 01:27:44.074
Are you Abhi or Amaya?

01:27:44.264 --> 01:27:45.114
I am Abhi.

01:27:45.264 --> 01:27:46.454
How can I believe you?

01:27:47.484 --> 01:27:50.494
Hey! I said that I am Abhi.
- Yes, you are Abhi.

01:27:50.924 --> 01:27:52.964
Your parents have taught you well.

01:27:54.004 --> 01:27:55.774
Will you have some tea?
- Yes.

01:27:55.864 --> 01:27:57.594
Sir, one more tea.
- Okay.

01:27:59.124 --> 01:28:02.744
Is your work going well?
Are you working properly?

01:28:03.244 --> 01:28:05.494
It's going well.

01:28:05.604 --> 01:28:06.944
But there is one guy.

01:28:07.044 --> 01:28:10.234
He is finding fault in everything.

01:28:10.394 --> 01:28:13.244
He is irritating me a lot.
- Hey, be careful.

01:28:13.524 --> 01:28:14.684
You might hit him.

01:28:14.974 --> 01:28:16.824
You need patience while working.

01:28:16.964 --> 01:28:18.324
Okay?
- Sir, tea.

01:28:18.444 --> 01:28:19.404
Give it to me.

01:28:20.544 --> 01:28:21.584
Take it.

01:28:23.044 --> 01:28:23.884
Thank you.

01:28:24.124 --> 01:28:25.124
Madam, bill?

01:28:25.374 --> 01:28:27.724
Sir, put it on his tab.

01:28:27.774 --> 01:28:29.044
Okay?
- This was expected.

01:28:29.414 --> 01:28:31.064
Put it on my tab.
- Okay, sir.

01:28:33.704 --> 01:28:36.994
Okay.. But don't lose focus
on your work.

01:28:37.164 --> 01:28:38.994
Mind your work.
- Hello.

01:28:39.084 --> 01:28:41.414
You're the one
always lamenting to Amaya.

01:28:41.504 --> 01:28:43.244
Are you advising me?

01:28:43.894 --> 01:28:45.644
You have an answer
for everything I say.

01:28:45.834 --> 01:28:46.754
How is it, Abhi?

01:28:46.914 --> 01:28:48.694
You need talent for that, Kamal.

01:28:49.294 --> 01:28:50.584
I don't have that talent.

01:28:54.544 --> 01:28:56.444
There is something.
- What is there?

01:28:57.334 --> 01:28:58.194
Where?

01:28:58.504 --> 01:28:59.774
This side.
- Here?

01:29:01.994 --> 01:29:03.084
Wait, I will take it.

01:29:08.044 --> 01:29:09.064
Thank you.

01:29:10.164 --> 01:29:11.764
Is it gone?
- Yes.

01:29:14.504 --> 01:29:15.764
What are you doing here, Abhi?

01:29:16.204 --> 01:29:18.704
Hey, I came to meet Kamal.

01:29:18.874 --> 01:29:22.224
I told you not to come here
after the problem, right?

01:29:23.084 --> 01:29:24.424
I didn't step into the hospital.

01:29:24.514 --> 01:29:26.234
I am just sitting
in the canteen outside.

01:29:27.834 --> 01:29:29.034
I didn't call her.

01:29:30.704 --> 01:29:32.054
You leave from here.

01:29:34.774 --> 01:29:37.044
Kamal, she won't let us talk
if I stay here.

01:29:37.134 --> 01:29:39.144
We can meet outside and talk.

01:29:39.214 --> 01:29:40.944
Call me after your shift is over.

01:29:41.294 --> 01:29:42.664
Why do you want to meet outside?

01:29:43.954 --> 01:29:46.664
Amaya, I am talking to him
about my work.

01:29:46.984 --> 01:29:50.144
What is your problem
if I talk to him?

01:29:50.274 --> 01:29:52.614
You've thanked him
for getting you a job, right?

01:29:53.294 --> 01:29:55.524
You can't stay here anymore.
You leave from here.

01:29:56.714 --> 01:29:58.794
I don't think you are angry
because I came here.

01:29:59.084 --> 01:30:01.354
I think you are angry
because I spoke to Kamal.

01:30:01.544 --> 01:30:03.634
You have had
the same problem since childhood.

01:30:03.894 --> 01:30:06.314
You avoid people when
they are kind towards you.

01:30:06.574 --> 01:30:09.304
If you continue to be like this,
no one will be there for us.

01:30:12.004 --> 01:30:12.934
Why, Abhi?

01:30:13.544 --> 01:30:14.414
Bye, Kamal.

01:30:14.704 --> 01:30:16.674
Abhi.. Be careful.

01:30:20.754 --> 01:30:21.694
Amaya, wait.

01:30:22.094 --> 01:30:22.924
Wait!

01:30:24.224 --> 01:30:25.144
What?

01:30:25.294 --> 01:30:26.324
You don't talk to me.

01:30:26.474 --> 01:30:28.634
You scolded Abhi
when she speaks to me.

01:30:29.204 --> 01:30:30.634
What you did is not right.

01:30:30.684 --> 01:30:32.124
What were you both laughing at?

01:30:32.334 --> 01:30:35.354
We were just talking and laughing.
Why do you care?

01:30:35.544 --> 01:30:36.804
I don't like it.
- What..

01:30:37.284 --> 01:30:38.944
This is unfair.
Wait..

01:30:39.414 --> 01:30:40.324
Okay.

01:30:40.514 --> 01:30:41.824
I won't talk to her hereafter.

01:30:42.204 --> 01:30:43.704
Will you talk to me?
- No.

01:30:43.954 --> 01:30:44.794
I knew it.

01:30:44.954 --> 01:30:46.174
Wait a minute.

01:30:46.454 --> 01:30:48.594
I am talking to you,
but you are just walking away.

01:30:49.954 --> 01:30:52.664
Both the sisters
are making a fool out of me.

01:30:53.664 --> 01:30:54.504
My bad luck.

01:31:02.804 --> 01:31:03.664
Reena.

01:31:12.294 --> 01:31:13.754
Why did you return
to work so soon?

01:31:13.794 --> 01:31:15.534
You could have taken
a longer break.

01:31:16.714 --> 01:31:18.344
I thought the same.

01:31:20.384 --> 01:31:24.384
But Uncle Ganesh
insisted on my going to work.

01:31:25.794 --> 01:31:27.734
He said it would be
a change for me.

01:31:28.634 --> 01:31:30.054
How is Mr. Ganesh?

01:31:32.404 --> 01:31:34.164
He was fine in front of me.

01:31:35.164 --> 01:31:38.074
But after I came here..

01:31:39.374 --> 01:31:41.244
I don't know how he is going to be.

01:31:42.274 --> 01:31:44.384
Shall I ask my dad to visit him?

01:31:44.434 --> 01:31:45.284
No, ma'am.

01:31:45.304 --> 01:31:51.534
I want to hire a caretaker
who can watch him 24x7.

01:31:52.044 --> 01:31:52.984
Okay.

01:31:56.504 --> 01:31:57.654
How are you?

01:32:04.374 --> 01:32:06.954
We could have tried a little more.

01:32:09.204 --> 01:32:14.204
We could have done a transplant
and saved Aunt Saradha somehow.

01:32:15.924 --> 01:32:19.244
Reena, you tried your best.

01:32:19.874 --> 01:32:23.434
Likewise, all the doctors
in our hospital tried their best.

01:32:24.374 --> 01:32:29.154
But we can't do anything if certain
things go against our wishes.

01:32:30.404 --> 01:32:34.644
Don't blame yourself for this.

01:32:36.184 --> 01:32:37.074
Do you understand?

01:32:43.134 --> 01:32:43.954
Okay.

01:32:46.534 --> 01:32:47.384
Okay, ma'am.

01:32:56.084 --> 01:32:56.974
Hey.

01:33:00.004 --> 01:33:02.044
What happened, sir?
- I don't know, Doctor.

01:33:02.124 --> 01:33:03.694
He has been having
a stomach ache since last night.

01:33:03.834 --> 01:33:05.194
He has got a loose..

01:33:05.484 --> 01:33:07.124
Delivery.. Release..

01:33:07.164 --> 01:33:09.544
Motion?
- Yes, it's loose motion, Doctor.

01:33:10.174 --> 01:33:11.764
What did you eat?
- Fried rice.

01:33:11.814 --> 01:33:12.724
Fried rice.

01:33:12.844 --> 01:33:14.594
In a restaurant?
- Yes.

01:33:15.364 --> 01:33:16.204
Sir?

01:33:16.244 --> 01:33:18.414
If he wants to eat something,
you can cook it at home.

01:33:18.454 --> 01:33:20.874
Why are you buying it from outside?
- No, Doctor.

01:33:21.004 --> 01:33:24.044
My wife won't cook non-veg
for the whole month.

01:33:24.204 --> 01:33:26.044
But my son really wished for it.

01:33:26.124 --> 01:33:28.964
So, I bought it for him.
- Okay, leave it.

01:33:29.104 --> 01:33:30.764
Don't worry.
- Just one..

01:33:34.704 --> 01:33:35.574
I don't understand.

01:33:37.324 --> 01:33:38.984
Oh, you mean an injection?

01:33:39.124 --> 01:33:40.904
Oh, no, Doctor.

01:33:40.984 --> 01:33:44.774
I was saying that he fears injections,
but you told him already.

01:33:48.064 --> 01:33:49.574
Is he a little boy?

01:33:49.624 --> 01:33:51.184
Is he a small boy, sir?

01:33:51.724 --> 01:33:53.114
He is not afraid of injections, sir.

01:33:53.624 --> 01:33:55.374
Hey, look here.

01:33:55.504 --> 01:33:56.704
I'm going to inject you now.

01:33:58.264 --> 01:33:59.344
Why are you so shocked?

01:34:00.414 --> 01:34:01.884
Here, take the chocolate.

01:34:02.334 --> 01:34:03.174
Look here.

01:34:03.244 --> 01:34:06.584
I'm a specialist in administering
injections without pain.

01:34:06.714 --> 01:34:09.644
You shouted when I stabbed you
with just a pen, won't it hurt me?

01:34:10.334 --> 01:34:12.224
Hey, you stabbed me
without telling me.

01:34:12.304 --> 01:34:14.914
That's why I shouted. I'm injecting
you after telling you. So, it won't.

01:34:17.544 --> 01:34:18.634
First..

01:34:19.544 --> 01:34:21.484
The medicine in this bottle

01:34:21.794 --> 01:34:23.684
should be taken in this syringe.

01:34:24.914 --> 01:34:26.134
After that.

01:34:26.484 --> 01:34:28.384
Through this syringe

01:34:28.914 --> 01:34:30.884
it should be injected
into your body.

01:34:33.454 --> 01:34:37.434
Before you finish eating
the chocolate, I'll inject you.

01:34:37.564 --> 01:34:39.004
The taste of that chocolate..

01:34:40.124 --> 01:34:41.114
Taste?

01:34:42.124 --> 01:34:44.374
Hey, am I narrating a story?

01:34:44.484 --> 01:34:45.764
You are narrating it practically.

01:34:45.874 --> 01:34:46.834
Where is the boy?

01:34:46.884 --> 01:34:49.134
Oh, no, where is my son?

01:34:49.754 --> 01:34:51.204
I told you earlier.

01:34:51.324 --> 01:34:53.914
My son is afraid of injections.
You could've done it silently.

01:34:53.974 --> 01:34:55.104
Don't talk like a fool, sir.

01:34:55.204 --> 01:34:56.664
How can I inject him silently?

01:34:56.754 --> 01:34:58.924
Oh, no, where will I find my son?

01:34:59.004 --> 01:34:59.874
My son.

01:34:59.954 --> 01:35:01.594
Where is he?
- Sir..

01:35:02.104 --> 01:35:03.424
Why did you pull me up?

01:35:03.574 --> 01:35:04.404
Don't worry, sir.

01:35:04.584 --> 01:35:06.114
We will find your son
and inject him.

01:35:06.624 --> 01:35:08.774
But please help me, sir.

01:35:08.864 --> 01:35:10.554
Should I get another syringe?

01:35:11.374 --> 01:35:13.774
Sir, don't tell anyone about this.

01:35:14.064 --> 01:35:16.664
Doctor, I have only one son.

01:35:16.724 --> 01:35:18.584
Don't worry, sir.
I'll find him for sure.

01:35:18.624 --> 01:35:19.594
What is your son's name?

01:35:19.644 --> 01:35:20.724
Appukutty.

01:35:22.374 --> 01:35:26.054
But everyone at home
calls him Kutty.

01:35:26.134 --> 01:35:30.064
But his grandfather
calls him Ambalavanam.

01:35:30.134 --> 01:35:31.154
It's our family name.

01:35:31.184 --> 01:35:34.544
Ambalavanam Amanakundi.
- Not Amanakundi, sir. Appukutty.

01:35:34.564 --> 01:35:36.924
It is my responsibility
to find Ambalavanam Appukutty.

01:35:36.984 --> 01:35:38.754
Until then, you sit here.

01:35:39.334 --> 01:35:40.344
Can I trust you?

01:35:40.454 --> 01:35:41.554
Appukutty.

01:35:42.304 --> 01:35:43.924
Kutty, hey.

01:35:44.144 --> 01:35:45.264
Appukutty..

01:35:45.794 --> 01:35:47.904
Hey, how do you know my name?
- Hey.

01:35:48.004 --> 01:35:48.844
Don't poke my eyes.

01:35:49.004 --> 01:35:53.424
No.. When I was in school,
everyone used to call me Kutty.

01:35:53.504 --> 01:35:55.274
Hey, fool, not only you.

01:35:55.544 --> 01:35:59.674
99.9% of the children
in Tamil Nadu are called as Kutty.

01:35:59.824 --> 01:36:03.624
Okay, then, why are you shouting
'Kutty' and looking under chairs?

01:36:03.804 --> 01:36:04.664
What is the matter?

01:36:05.004 --> 01:36:06.284
Nilofer..

01:36:06.994 --> 01:36:09.114
I tried to inject a patient.

01:36:09.544 --> 01:36:11.234
He must be around 8 years old.

01:36:11.264 --> 01:36:12.214
Okay.

01:36:13.454 --> 01:36:16.154
He is missing, Nilofer.
- What, a child is missing?

01:36:16.484 --> 01:36:18.464
Hey, you were talking
normally until now.

01:36:18.534 --> 01:36:20.244
Why are you shouting
in a high pitch? - Hey!

01:36:20.324 --> 01:36:22.284
Do you know how serious
the problem is? - Oh, no..

01:36:22.794 --> 01:36:23.764
Oh, no..

01:36:23.824 --> 01:36:25.514
Did they kidnap the child?

01:36:25.684 --> 01:36:27.624
Rocky, I watched a movie yesterday.

01:36:27.734 --> 01:36:28.694
Even in that movie

01:36:28.744 --> 01:36:30.624
they kidnap the child
and give it to another family.

01:36:30.724 --> 01:36:32.994
Nilofer, he is scared
of injections.

01:36:33.124 --> 01:36:35.164
So he is hiding somewhere.
- Hey.

01:36:35.284 --> 01:36:36.754
You rarely get to treat patients.

01:36:36.804 --> 01:36:38.814
Don't you know
how to handle one patient?

01:36:39.044 --> 01:36:40.194
What can I do?

01:36:40.274 --> 01:36:41.714
This is what
all my patients are like.

01:36:41.794 --> 01:36:44.824
Either he creates trouble
or he is a trouble himself.

01:36:45.504 --> 01:36:46.534
Oh, no..

01:36:47.034 --> 01:36:48.164
All you do is talk.

01:36:50.504 --> 01:36:51.754
Come, there is a nurse.

01:36:51.824 --> 01:36:53.294
Let's ask her.
- Oh, no.

01:36:53.434 --> 01:36:54.514
Don't ask her anything.

01:36:54.604 --> 01:36:56.814
How will you search
in such a big hospital?

01:36:58.924 --> 01:37:01.264
Nilofer, help me with two things.

01:37:01.664 --> 01:37:03.954
Tell me, Rocky.
Shall I also search with you?

01:37:04.064 --> 01:37:05.114
No, Nilofer.

01:37:05.264 --> 01:37:10.244
Even if I ask you for help,
don't plan to help me, please.

01:37:13.544 --> 01:37:14.414
Second thing?

01:37:14.764 --> 01:37:17.284
D-Don't tell this to anyone.

01:37:18.244 --> 01:37:19.634
I wanted to help you, right?

01:37:19.754 --> 01:37:20.704
You won't find him.

01:37:20.864 --> 01:37:22.244
Search for Kutty.

01:37:22.334 --> 01:37:24.284
You won't find him, waste fellow.
- You..

01:37:24.544 --> 01:37:25.704
Kutty..

01:37:26.204 --> 01:37:27.434
Appukutty.

01:37:42.084 --> 01:37:42.984
Krithika..

01:37:45.664 --> 01:37:47.434
Don't think that
you don't have anyone.

01:37:49.084 --> 01:37:50.694
They will take good care of you.

01:37:50.834 --> 01:37:53.604
You can call me
whenever you want to talk.

01:37:54.164 --> 01:37:57.214
You can tell me your problems.

01:37:57.754 --> 01:37:59.024
I will take care of you.

01:37:59.244 --> 01:38:00.164
Okay?

01:38:03.244 --> 01:38:04.334
Dr. Vijay.

01:38:08.794 --> 01:38:12.624
Our organisation has
many branches all over India.

01:38:12.764 --> 01:38:16.984
You have admitted many children
in our orphanage who are helpless.

01:38:17.204 --> 01:38:18.924
Even after admitting them

01:38:19.614 --> 01:38:24.044
you keep checking if they
are safe and comfortable.

01:38:24.364 --> 01:38:25.294
But still..

01:38:27.524 --> 01:38:28.694
Take care of this child.

01:38:29.184 --> 01:38:30.224
Okay.

01:38:33.564 --> 01:38:34.564
Krithika..

01:38:35.114 --> 01:38:36.144
Shall we go?

01:38:45.914 --> 01:38:46.794
Come, dear.

01:38:46.874 --> 01:38:47.704
Bye.

01:39:18.494 --> 01:39:19.414
Sir.

01:39:19.834 --> 01:39:22.114
Instead of just doing your job

01:39:22.204 --> 01:39:24.624
you are going an extra mile
to do something.

01:39:25.704 --> 01:39:26.624
Super, sir.

01:39:28.124 --> 01:39:28.944
Sir..

01:39:30.364 --> 01:39:34.074
Do you really help many children
and shelter them in orphanages?

01:39:37.314 --> 01:39:40.464
I find many children like Krithika
when I go for investigations.

01:39:41.124 --> 01:39:42.794
The people who came now..

01:39:43.834 --> 01:39:46.214
I usually send those children
to their orphanage.

01:39:46.954 --> 01:39:48.834
I am supporting them
as much as I can.

01:39:50.414 --> 01:39:52.664
Why are you so concerned
about children, sir?

01:39:55.544 --> 01:39:57.934
To be honest,
I am doing this for a reason.

01:39:58.734 --> 01:39:59.654
You know it, right?

01:40:01.244 --> 01:40:31.244
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

01:40:02.084 --> 01:40:03.104
I didn't get married.

01:40:03.514 --> 01:40:05.494
Everyone in the hospital
knows that, sir.

01:40:09.044 --> 01:40:10.234
But I was about to be a father.

01:40:11.104 --> 01:40:12.324
I was supposed to have a child.

01:40:15.754 --> 01:40:16.884
But I lost the child.

01:40:18.334 --> 01:40:19.434
I couldn't save the child.

01:40:19.494 --> 01:40:20.334
So..

01:40:21.124 --> 01:40:22.874
I am helping these
children as much as I can.

01:40:25.024 --> 01:40:27.084
Sir, you shouldn't mistake me.

01:40:27.604 --> 01:40:29.004
You said you didn't get married.

01:40:29.164 --> 01:40:30.044
But the child..

01:40:35.414 --> 01:40:36.704
That's a long story, Kamal.

01:40:37.744 --> 01:40:39.634
Time would pass quickly
if I began to explain.

01:40:42.004 --> 01:40:42.844
Do one thing.

01:40:42.864 --> 01:40:43.744
Sir..

01:40:44.864 --> 01:40:46.134
There is a new case here.

01:40:46.304 --> 01:40:47.714
Okay, sir.
- Follow this.

01:40:47.874 --> 01:40:48.764
Sure, sir.

01:40:50.504 --> 01:40:51.954
I am leaving, sir.
- You can go.

01:40:56.704 --> 01:40:57.784
What? Go.

01:41:13.374 --> 01:41:14.424
Okay.

01:41:15.344 --> 01:41:16.874
Let me check this case.
- Kutty!

01:41:17.004 --> 01:41:18.244
Appukutty!

01:41:18.324 --> 01:41:19.204
Look there.

01:41:19.704 --> 01:41:20.994
Who are you calling Kutty?

01:41:21.044 --> 01:41:22.644
Reena, did you see Kutty?

01:41:23.954 --> 01:41:24.984
Who is Kutty?

01:41:25.414 --> 01:41:26.954
Kutty.. a child, Reena.

01:41:27.044 --> 01:41:28.944
A patient.
- What is the child's name?

01:41:29.794 --> 01:41:32.774
Kamal, the child's name is Kutty.
Short for Appukutty.

01:41:33.084 --> 01:41:34.004
Oh!

01:41:34.414 --> 01:41:35.294
Wait a minute.

01:41:35.664 --> 01:41:36.574
Did you lose the patient?

01:41:36.834 --> 01:41:38.054
Did you lose him?

01:41:39.574 --> 01:41:40.964
Oh, no!
- Idiot.

01:41:41.054 --> 01:41:42.374
How did you lose the patient?

01:41:42.444 --> 01:41:44.414
Reena, I didn't lose him.

01:41:44.454 --> 01:41:46.044
I turned around to get a syringe..

01:41:46.084 --> 01:41:47.584
But he disappeared
before I could turn back.

01:41:47.624 --> 01:41:49.124
That boy might be
scared of injections.

01:41:49.324 --> 01:41:50.544
You should be careful.

01:41:50.664 --> 01:41:53.164
Kamal, be quiet.
Will you come with me?

01:41:53.284 --> 01:41:55.694
I can't come.
Dr. Vijay has given me a task.

01:41:55.754 --> 01:41:57.144
I can't come now, sorry.

01:41:57.254 --> 01:42:00.434
Reena, I told you..
- Kamal, I have helped you a lot.

01:42:00.794 --> 01:42:02.414
You? Give me one example.

01:42:03.664 --> 01:42:05.774
Kamal, let's write this first.

01:42:05.874 --> 01:42:07.164
Then, I will help you.

01:42:07.504 --> 01:42:08.824
Come.
- Reena.

01:42:09.794 --> 01:42:11.414
Reena, you go and do your work.

01:42:11.504 --> 01:42:14.884
He is enough for me.
- Dr. Vijay has given me a task.

01:42:14.954 --> 01:42:17.204
Kamal, I have to catch
Appukutty with your help.

01:42:17.264 --> 01:42:19.534
Try to understand, come
- How will you do that?

01:42:19.624 --> 01:42:23.414
Hey, Appukutty..
- Appukutty..

01:42:24.044 --> 01:42:25.254
Appukutty.
- Appukutty..

01:42:25.844 --> 01:42:26.744
Appu..

01:42:28.784 --> 01:42:29.734
Reena.

01:42:34.944 --> 01:42:35.924
How are you?

01:42:36.704 --> 01:42:37.864
Are you fine now?

01:42:39.384 --> 01:42:40.194
I am fine.

01:42:41.134 --> 01:42:42.754
There were some formalities.

01:42:43.354 --> 01:42:45.674
That's why everyone had
to assemble in Dr. Vijay's cabin.

01:42:45.834 --> 01:42:46.684
Oh.

01:42:47.274 --> 01:42:48.484
Do you know something, Arjun?

01:42:48.754 --> 01:42:49.574
What?

01:42:50.084 --> 01:42:53.644
Dr. Vijay has enrolled
Krithika in an orphanage.

01:42:55.834 --> 01:42:59.234
He has helped
many children like this.

01:43:00.484 --> 01:43:01.534
Not only that.

01:43:02.874 --> 01:43:04.684
He said that he had a child.

01:43:08.914 --> 01:43:14.454
When he said that, I realised
how much he missed his child.

01:43:21.324 --> 01:43:22.274
Reena.

01:43:25.124 --> 01:43:26.304
I have something to tell you.

01:43:28.234 --> 01:43:29.334
Tell me, Arjun.

01:43:39.204 --> 01:43:40.184
Tell me, Arjun.

01:43:40.544 --> 01:43:41.374
That is..

01:43:43.114 --> 01:43:44.094
Actually..

01:43:45.834 --> 01:43:48.924
The medical association is
hosting a party this evening.

01:43:50.414 --> 01:43:52.344
So, will you come?

01:43:56.664 --> 01:43:58.884
I am not in a position
to attend any parties, Arjun.

01:43:59.334 --> 01:44:00.644
I understand, Reena.

01:44:01.614 --> 01:44:03.214
But I have to go.

01:44:04.504 --> 01:44:05.794
There will be drinks at the party.

01:44:06.624 --> 01:44:09.094
I am sober from the time
I started playing badminton.

01:44:11.504 --> 01:44:14.154
If you come to the party,
I might be in control.

01:44:15.624 --> 01:44:17.324
It will be a moral support for me.

01:44:18.874 --> 01:44:19.984
Reena, sorry.

01:44:21.504 --> 01:44:22.854
I am not forcing you.

01:44:24.204 --> 01:44:25.534
But I think I need your help.

01:44:29.024 --> 01:44:30.224
Okay, I'll come.

01:44:30.914 --> 01:44:32.004
Thank you, Reena.

01:44:33.674 --> 01:44:35.524
I have a meeting now,
let's meet in the evening.

01:44:36.164 --> 01:44:37.034
Bye.

01:44:41.584 --> 01:44:42.424
Ma'am.

01:44:43.004 --> 01:44:43.954
Come, Arjun.

01:44:44.064 --> 01:44:45.264
Did you check
the mail and circulars?

01:44:47.694 --> 01:44:48.534
Yes, I did.

01:44:48.664 --> 01:44:50.824
The party is this evening, right?
I'll join.

01:44:52.164 --> 01:44:53.014
Ma'am.

01:44:53.334 --> 01:44:54.364
Tell me, Arjun.

01:44:59.554 --> 01:45:02.524
Is Dr. Vijay Reena's father?

01:45:10.794 --> 01:45:11.764
How did you know?

01:45:14.194 --> 01:45:15.284
I didn't know, ma'am.

01:45:16.584 --> 01:45:18.284
During Mrs. Saradha's funeral

01:45:18.604 --> 01:45:20.624
Dr. Vijay said that
you were his high school love.

01:45:21.704 --> 01:45:23.364
I calculated all the possibilities.

01:45:24.334 --> 01:45:25.394
But I wasn't sure.

01:45:27.504 --> 01:45:29.444
I confirmed it
with the reaction you gave me now.

01:45:32.704 --> 01:45:34.214
He told me not to tell anyone.

01:45:37.114 --> 01:45:38.544
But I couldn't, ma'am.

01:45:44.204 --> 01:45:45.054
Arjun.

01:45:45.454 --> 01:45:47.554
Reena shouldn't know this.

01:45:48.774 --> 01:45:49.804
Why, ma'am?

01:45:50.984 --> 01:45:54.734
I don't know if Dr. Vijay knows
that Reena is his daughter.

01:45:56.264 --> 01:45:57.494
Neither of them knows.

01:45:59.704 --> 01:46:02.104
So, why?

01:46:03.744 --> 01:46:05.234
There are many reasons, Arjun.

01:46:05.874 --> 01:46:09.644
And I didn't want Vijay
to create a new problem.

01:46:14.574 --> 01:46:15.554
Don't worry, ma'am.

01:46:17.054 --> 01:46:18.824
I won't blabber
like I did last time.

01:46:19.974 --> 01:46:20.874
But..

01:46:21.394 --> 01:46:24.234
Reena deserves
to know the truth, ma'am.

01:46:27.184 --> 01:46:30.964
I think it's right for you to say
that Reena is Dr. Vijay's daughter.

01:46:32.704 --> 01:46:34.524
It's not that easy, Arjun.

01:46:35.394 --> 01:46:37.844
You don't know
how Vijay abandoned me.

01:46:39.014 --> 01:46:41.464
The pain I endured
for trusting him..

01:46:42.624 --> 01:46:44.204
Reena doesn't deserve that pain.

01:46:44.504 --> 01:46:46.194
There might be many reasons, ma'am.

01:46:46.754 --> 01:46:47.764
And I respect that.

01:46:49.904 --> 01:46:52.674
All this time, you didn't
reveal Reena's father's identity.

01:46:53.414 --> 01:46:54.424
That was different, ma'am.

01:46:55.084 --> 01:46:56.164
But now..

01:46:59.044 --> 01:47:01.044
They don't even know that
they are father and daughter.

01:47:01.204 --> 01:47:02.624
They are working together, ma'am.

01:47:05.374 --> 01:47:07.274
They meet each other every day.

01:47:08.624 --> 01:47:12.494
I feel it's wrong to hide
the truth about Dr. Vijay.

01:47:15.474 --> 01:47:16.764
I think you should think about it.

01:48:46.738 --> 01:48:49.708
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:48:51.708 --> 01:48:54.168
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:48:56.798 --> 01:48:59.598
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:49:01.478 --> 01:49:03.778
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:49:03.918 --> 01:49:06.458
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:49:06.518 --> 01:49:09.298
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:49:09.368 --> 01:49:11.738
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:49:14.138 --> 01:49:16.688
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:49:19.168 --> 01:49:21.728
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:49:24.028 --> 01:49:28.058
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:49:41.118 --> 01:49:43.538
Are you so careless
that you missed a child?

01:49:45.678 --> 01:49:48.898
Sir, how could I inject him
without mentioning it to him?

01:49:49.008 --> 01:49:51.288
I even gave him chocolate.

01:49:52.558 --> 01:49:54.758
Did the child have a patient tag?
- Yes.

01:49:54.888 --> 01:49:57.508
Did you check the CCTV?
- I checked all the CCTVs.

01:49:57.668 --> 01:49:59.478
I didn't find the boy
in any of them.

01:50:00.018 --> 01:50:01.948
We tried to find the boy.

01:50:02.548 --> 01:50:05.128
We searched everywhere.

01:50:05.178 --> 01:50:06.598
But we couldn't find him.

01:50:06.748 --> 01:50:09.338
How can you miss a child?

01:50:11.278 --> 01:50:13.918
Sir, you are
an investigation officer, right?

01:50:13.968 --> 01:50:15.108
Yes, so?

01:50:16.598 --> 01:50:19.598
If you help us,
we can find the boy together.

01:50:19.728 --> 01:50:21.618
Yes, I am here to investigate that.

01:50:22.758 --> 01:50:25.298
What is this, sir?
We are colleagues, right?

01:50:25.668 --> 01:50:28.168
I have a meeting now,
I can't help you.

01:50:29.298 --> 01:50:30.358
Ask Teju to come.

01:50:30.718 --> 01:50:31.688
What? Teju?

01:50:32.288 --> 01:50:33.358
Sir, why are you calling her?

01:50:34.158 --> 01:50:35.698
She will finish me, sir.

01:50:35.838 --> 01:50:38.088
Ask Teju to come to my cabin.
- Okay, sir.

01:50:41.138 --> 01:50:42.028
Sir, did you call me?

01:50:43.798 --> 01:50:44.798
Rocky has...

01:50:46.758 --> 01:50:48.128
He lost his patient.

01:50:48.808 --> 01:50:49.818
The patient is a child.

01:50:50.078 --> 01:50:51.258
You see what it is.

01:50:56.038 --> 01:50:57.958
Sorry, sir.
This is not my job.

01:50:59.718 --> 01:51:00.538
Really?

01:51:02.068 --> 01:51:03.638
A patient named Sakshi.

01:51:04.238 --> 01:51:05.958
You booked
a fake appointment for her.

01:51:06.248 --> 01:51:09.108
You used ward boys
and created a drama to help her.

01:51:10.078 --> 01:51:11.478
That was not your job either.

01:51:14.918 --> 01:51:15.758
Sir..

01:51:16.158 --> 01:51:17.878
You made Teju go quiet!

01:51:18.548 --> 01:51:19.528
Won't you shake my hands?

01:51:20.838 --> 01:51:21.718
You are great, sir.

01:51:23.468 --> 01:51:24.398
Teju..

01:51:24.718 --> 01:51:25.948
I saw your personality.

01:51:26.138 --> 01:51:27.328
I saw what you do.

01:51:27.418 --> 01:51:29.568
I thought
you would be interested in this.

01:51:29.768 --> 01:51:31.288
Will you do it?

01:51:34.718 --> 01:51:35.768
I will do it, sir.

01:51:36.518 --> 01:51:40.988
Doctor, I told you not to tell
my son about the injection.

01:51:41.118 --> 01:51:43.138
Then why did you tell him?
Look now.

01:51:43.278 --> 01:51:45.548
I don't know where my son is.

01:51:45.838 --> 01:51:47.238
Appukutty..

01:51:47.928 --> 01:51:49.998
I am going to the police station.
- Oh, no.

01:51:50.058 --> 01:51:51.028
Sir..

01:51:51.358 --> 01:51:52.418
Don't go to the police.

01:51:52.538 --> 01:51:54.978
She will find your son.

01:51:55.048 --> 01:51:56.538
Don't talk like a fool.

01:51:56.648 --> 01:51:59.338
She is eating
a lollipop like a child.

01:51:59.438 --> 01:52:01.588
How will she find him?
Are you kidding me?

01:52:01.868 --> 01:52:05.758
Sir, she can investigate
only if she eats a lollipop.

01:52:05.788 --> 01:52:06.978
I've never heard of this before.

01:52:07.468 --> 01:52:09.588
Did you search the entire hospital?
- Yes, I did.

01:52:09.678 --> 01:52:10.728
He is not to be found anywhere.

01:52:12.768 --> 01:52:14.208
When did your son eat last?

01:52:14.338 --> 01:52:16.098
He ate a little in the morning.

01:52:16.148 --> 01:52:17.888
Why are you asking?
- So that she can eat the rest.

01:52:17.958 --> 01:52:19.058
You..

01:52:19.108 --> 01:52:20.618
I understood.

01:52:20.838 --> 01:52:22.568
I searched the canteen.
He was not there.

01:52:23.938 --> 01:52:25.368
Did you check the CCTV footage?

01:52:25.688 --> 01:52:28.558
Teju, he played smartly here.

01:52:29.008 --> 01:52:31.288
He didn't get caught
in any of the CCTVs.

01:52:32.038 --> 01:52:35.148
How is that possible?
- He didn't get caught.

01:52:35.718 --> 01:52:37.698
If he didn't get
caught in the CCTV

01:52:38.568 --> 01:52:39.978
There is only one possibility.

01:52:40.878 --> 01:52:42.108
He must be in the ward.

01:52:43.038 --> 01:52:43.858
Teju..

01:52:44.078 --> 01:52:45.818
Please don't say that.

01:52:46.078 --> 01:52:48.768
I searched every room here.

01:52:48.868 --> 01:52:51.158
Doctor..
Did you search the toilet?

01:52:51.608 --> 01:52:53.708
Why, sir?
- He's suffering from diarrhea.

01:52:54.238 --> 01:52:55.308
I searched, sir.

01:52:56.608 --> 01:52:58.138
Teju, please don't say that.
He is not there.

01:52:58.278 --> 01:53:00.548
Did you search
the ward properly or not?

01:53:01.638 --> 01:53:04.528
Teju, I searched
the ward thoroughly.

01:53:04.638 --> 01:53:05.538
He is not here.

01:53:09.518 --> 01:53:10.278
That's it, sir.

01:53:10.398 --> 01:53:11.708
She will ask questions
But she won't answer.

01:53:11.908 --> 01:53:13.468
Come, let's go.
- To the police station?

01:53:13.798 --> 01:53:14.938
Sir, come, sir.

01:53:15.038 --> 01:53:16.718
If I don't find my son,
you're finished.

01:53:28.138 --> 01:53:29.378
Appukutty..

01:53:30.428 --> 01:53:31.528
Sorry, madam.

01:53:34.708 --> 01:53:36.118
I searched thoroughly.

01:53:36.198 --> 01:53:37.618
But he will not be here.

01:53:38.058 --> 01:53:39.268
Why don't you believe me?

01:53:46.188 --> 01:53:47.038
What happened?

01:53:47.088 --> 01:53:48.228
Doctor..

01:53:48.448 --> 01:53:50.428
The food plate is missing.

01:53:50.508 --> 01:53:52.168
My son is also missing.

01:53:52.678 --> 01:53:55.028
Don't glare at me, Doctor.
- Things keep disappearing.

01:53:55.238 --> 01:53:56.288
Is there a ghost?

01:53:57.318 --> 01:53:59.518
Where did you keep it?
- I kept it here, Doctor.

01:54:00.158 --> 01:54:00.998
There?

01:54:12.598 --> 01:54:13.638
Hey, idiot.

01:54:13.878 --> 01:54:15.258
Doctor, she is calling you.

01:54:16.158 --> 01:54:17.128
Sorry, Doctor.

01:54:21.428 --> 01:54:22.628
Hey, Appukutty..

01:54:22.758 --> 01:54:24.258
What are you doing here?

01:54:26.238 --> 01:54:27.068
You..

01:54:27.198 --> 01:54:28.998
Teju, mind your language,
I am a doctor.

01:54:29.598 --> 01:54:31.298
Be happy that I stopped.

01:54:31.498 --> 01:54:32.838
I've got a list of words for you.

01:54:34.518 --> 01:54:36.798
Hey Kutty,
what are you doing here?

01:54:37.008 --> 01:54:39.968
That uncle was telling me
how to use an injection.

01:54:40.078 --> 01:54:41.508
I got scared on hearing that.

01:54:41.708 --> 01:54:42.528
Hey, Appu.

01:54:42.718 --> 01:54:44.168
I will slap you.

01:54:44.308 --> 01:54:46.718
Oh! He is my only Appu.

01:54:46.768 --> 01:54:48.218
Why have I ended up
with this family?

01:54:49.308 --> 01:54:50.188
Look, Appu..

01:54:50.238 --> 01:54:51.188
Did I scare you?

01:54:51.338 --> 01:54:53.178
I gave you chocolates
to inject you.

01:54:53.478 --> 01:54:54.398
Hey..

01:54:54.798 --> 01:54:57.638
Don't you know how to talk
to a child before injecting him?

01:54:58.238 --> 01:55:00.138
Inject him properly
and send him away.

01:55:01.358 --> 01:55:02.388
Idiot.

01:55:03.838 --> 01:55:05.258
Aunty, wait. I will also come.

01:55:05.508 --> 01:55:06.508
Hey..

01:55:06.658 --> 01:55:09.348
Don't hold him by the hair.
He might choke.

01:55:09.408 --> 01:55:10.658
I am only injecting him.

01:55:10.748 --> 01:55:13.188
I am injecting him.
- Okay.

01:55:14.308 --> 01:55:17.698
Good evening, everyone.
It's a pleasure meeting you all.

01:55:18.198 --> 01:55:22.908
Today, all the CEOs,
investors, specialists and doctors

01:55:23.048 --> 01:55:25.128
from various hospitals in Chennai

01:55:25.338 --> 01:55:27.508
have gathered here in one place.

01:55:28.238 --> 01:55:31.178
I would like to extend
my special thanks

01:55:31.228 --> 01:55:34.168
to the members who
made this possible.

01:55:34.998 --> 01:55:36.718
Let me come to the point.

01:55:37.238 --> 01:55:39.968
Whenever we think of hospitals

01:55:40.008 --> 01:55:46.138
our thoughts usually revolve around
patients, medicines, diagnoses

01:55:46.278 --> 01:55:50.668
and the doctors
to care for the patients.

01:55:50.998 --> 01:55:53.298
But in the institution..

01:55:54.758 --> 01:55:55.928
Excuse me, Doctor.

01:55:56.028 --> 01:55:57.068
Sure, Doctor.

01:56:01.558 --> 01:56:02.908
Not bad, Radhi.

01:56:03.488 --> 01:56:06.918
You have a beautiful family.

01:56:06.968 --> 01:56:09.698
Two children, Dev, your father.

01:56:11.518 --> 01:56:14.578
To be honest,
I am a bit jealous.

01:56:15.758 --> 01:56:17.098
You can see that, Vijay.

01:56:17.758 --> 01:56:20.588
I am living well,
along with my family.

01:56:21.238 --> 01:56:22.228
You can see that, right?

01:56:23.798 --> 01:56:26.148
Then, why are you
bringing up the past?

01:56:26.638 --> 01:56:28.238
You ask about closure.

01:56:28.778 --> 01:56:31.748
You have to move on
after a point in life, Vijay.

01:56:33.118 --> 01:56:34.278
I have moved on.

01:56:34.758 --> 01:56:36.638
That's why
I am explaining it to you.

01:56:37.068 --> 01:56:38.038
Yeah.

01:56:38.768 --> 01:56:39.768
I hear you.

01:56:40.168 --> 01:56:41.838
Then why are you still here?

01:56:41.878 --> 01:56:43.038
You can go back, right?

01:56:43.838 --> 01:56:44.838
I don't know, Radhi.

01:56:45.758 --> 01:56:49.438
Until I saw you, until I didn't
know where you were, I was fine.

01:56:50.808 --> 01:56:52.558
But after I saw you

01:56:53.408 --> 01:56:54.648
deep down inside..

01:56:56.118 --> 01:56:58.708
I feel like you are still
thinking about our lost child.

01:57:00.078 --> 01:57:03.178
I feel like you are struggling
inside and unable to express it.

01:57:04.598 --> 01:57:06.898
I feel like you haven't yet
moved on from that.

01:57:07.088 --> 01:57:08.068
Look, Vijay.

01:57:09.158 --> 01:57:10.598
I have said what I had to say.

01:57:12.168 --> 01:57:13.608
And I meant what I said.

01:57:14.458 --> 01:57:16.988
Don't keep repeating the same thing.
- Okay, sure.

01:57:17.838 --> 01:57:20.238
If you feel you have moved on,
then it's okay. Leave it.

01:57:20.928 --> 01:57:22.378
Why do you ask me to leave?

01:57:23.108 --> 01:57:24.928
You believe
that you have moved on, right?

01:57:25.758 --> 01:57:27.088
I should believe that too.

01:57:27.558 --> 01:57:29.558
I will go away
the moment I believe it.

01:57:30.028 --> 01:57:31.558
Why are you concerned about that?

01:57:32.778 --> 01:57:34.108
It's not for you, Radhi.

01:57:34.798 --> 01:57:35.728
It's for me.

01:57:36.238 --> 01:57:37.188
It's for me.

01:57:37.878 --> 01:57:40.318
Seeing you happy with your family

01:57:40.878 --> 01:57:42.198
I feel..

01:57:42.838 --> 01:57:44.438
Very depressed inside.

01:57:45.708 --> 01:57:47.728
I can't stay here, Radhi.

01:57:51.238 --> 01:57:52.728
Oh, I need a drink.

01:57:54.078 --> 01:57:55.238
You want a drink?

01:57:55.998 --> 01:57:57.798
Don't stare at me. I need a drink.

01:57:58.278 --> 01:57:59.278
I am going to get a drink.

01:57:59.908 --> 01:58:01.108
I will see you around.

01:58:09.448 --> 01:58:10.168
Hi sir.

01:58:11.108 --> 01:58:13.318
You are listening
to this speech so carefully?

01:58:14.238 --> 01:58:15.518
Conserve your energy, guys.

01:58:15.748 --> 01:58:17.248
This is going to go on
for a long time.

01:58:17.398 --> 01:58:19.638
You can listen
to this speech with a drink.

01:58:19.878 --> 01:58:21.338
Do you want to join me
for a drink, Arjun?

01:58:25.598 --> 01:58:26.438
No, sir.

01:58:26.708 --> 01:58:27.958
I have to drive again.

01:58:28.238 --> 01:58:29.038
So, no.

01:58:30.068 --> 01:58:30.948
Reena?

01:58:31.468 --> 01:58:32.698
No, sir, I don't drink.

01:58:32.918 --> 01:58:33.738
Okay.

01:58:33.858 --> 01:58:35.858
You are in the right vibe
for this party.

01:58:36.518 --> 01:58:37.948
At least, give me company.
- Yeah, sir.

01:58:38.098 --> 01:58:39.458
I will introduce
some people to you.

01:58:39.878 --> 01:58:41.468
Sure.
- I will be back, Reena.

01:58:41.838 --> 01:58:43.898
If you drink, that's it.

01:58:45.318 --> 01:58:46.828
No, Reena, I won't.
- Go.

01:58:49.868 --> 01:58:50.968
I don't know if I told you.

01:58:51.058 --> 01:58:53.588
But I am enjoying
our badminton practice.

01:58:53.838 --> 01:58:54.758
Thanks for that.

01:59:01.478 --> 01:59:03.158
Come.
- I hope I didn't disturb you.

01:59:03.328 --> 01:59:04.618
It's nothing. Sit down.

01:59:12.878 --> 01:59:14.108
How are you?

01:59:14.398 --> 01:59:15.908
I am fine.

01:59:20.158 --> 01:59:21.478
What brings you here?

01:59:21.798 --> 01:59:23.838
Something is bothering me.

01:59:24.438 --> 01:59:25.508
Tell me.

01:59:26.608 --> 01:59:27.668
Reena.

01:59:27.838 --> 01:59:29.878
She has been staying in your
house for two-three days.

01:59:31.438 --> 01:59:33.018
I'm fine with that.

01:59:34.518 --> 01:59:38.198
I am afraid that you might
separate her from me.

01:59:40.398 --> 01:59:41.948
What are you talking about?

01:59:42.398 --> 01:59:43.408
I mean..

01:59:44.538 --> 01:59:49.428
Reena said that she will
be with me till the end.

01:59:51.198 --> 01:59:56.088
But I am not the one who is
important to her than her family.

01:59:56.878 --> 01:59:57.748
What?

01:59:58.718 --> 02:00:01.098
Ganesh, do you know
what you are saying?

02:00:02.508 --> 02:00:05.508
When Reena came here
for the first time

02:00:05.998 --> 02:00:08.638
even before she got to know
that Radhi is her mother

02:00:08.758 --> 02:00:12.678
you gave her a place to stay
and treated her like a daughter.

02:00:13.638 --> 02:00:14.958
Don't I know all this?

02:00:15.318 --> 02:00:16.338
Did I forget?

02:00:16.958 --> 02:00:18.108
Did Reena forget?

02:00:19.218 --> 02:00:22.908
If Reena learns
that you spoke to me like this

02:00:23.718 --> 02:00:27.658
we can't bear her wrath.

02:00:29.158 --> 02:00:30.088
Trust me.

02:00:30.558 --> 02:00:33.688
Reena will never leave you.

02:00:34.398 --> 02:00:35.348
Okay?

02:00:35.928 --> 02:00:36.888
Please.

02:00:37.558 --> 02:00:39.478
I am scared.

02:00:39.958 --> 02:00:41.038
What is this?

02:00:41.318 --> 02:00:46.428
You are going to overthink
and complicate your life.

02:00:48.428 --> 02:00:49.728
Don't think about anything.

02:00:49.918 --> 02:00:51.118
Simply leave it.

02:00:51.248 --> 02:00:52.248
Be free.

02:00:58.028 --> 02:00:59.038
Reena.

02:01:01.378 --> 02:01:02.988
I have been observing you
since I came here.

02:01:03.958 --> 02:01:05.558
You are not talking to me.

02:01:07.698 --> 02:01:09.988
I don't know
what to talk to you about, Manasa.

02:01:11.338 --> 02:01:13.098
Do you really not know
what to talk to me about?

02:01:13.198 --> 02:01:15.178
Or you don't want to talk to me?

02:01:17.368 --> 02:01:18.608
I don't understand.

02:01:21.118 --> 02:01:24.378
Arjun must have told you
about my love confession.

02:01:28.078 --> 02:01:29.898
But you should be happy.

02:01:31.348 --> 02:01:33.258
Because Arjun rejected me.

02:01:34.238 --> 02:01:36.908
Manasa, you told Arjun
about your feelings.

02:01:37.538 --> 02:01:40.288
He said that he doesn't
have any feelings for you.

02:01:40.638 --> 02:01:42.788
What is there for me
to be happy about?

02:01:44.158 --> 02:01:46.438
In the hospital,
Kiran had said that he likes me.

02:01:46.528 --> 02:01:48.798
But I told him I'm not interested
and he left it at that.

02:01:48.998 --> 02:01:50.168
This is also the same.

02:01:55.478 --> 02:01:58.598
I hope you won't
disturb Arjun anymore.

02:02:07.968 --> 02:02:09.528
I don't understand, Reena.

02:02:10.318 --> 02:02:12.358
You both are not
in a relationship now.

02:02:12.798 --> 02:02:13.968
You are not dating either.

02:02:15.638 --> 02:02:18.028
So if I want to impress Arjun

02:02:19.068 --> 02:02:21.338
why are you telling me
not to disturb him?

02:02:22.438 --> 02:02:24.118
I am not saying this
for my sake, Manasa.

02:02:25.818 --> 02:02:27.698
I don't think so.

02:02:54.478 --> 02:02:58.048
It is a good process
for Arjun to come out of this.

02:02:58.598 --> 02:03:00.848
But we should not leave him
alone at this time.

02:03:05.278 --> 02:03:06.158
So?

02:03:07.078 --> 02:03:08.838
Can we be friends from now on?

02:03:35.568 --> 02:03:36.558
What is this?

02:03:36.838 --> 02:04:06.838
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

02:03:37.808 --> 02:03:38.628
What?

02:03:38.878 --> 02:03:41.628
This tastes weird, Manasa.

02:03:42.208 --> 02:03:43.048
Wait.

02:03:43.198 --> 02:03:44.138
Excuse me.

02:03:46.758 --> 02:03:49.278
Madam.
- She had ordered a fruit mocktail.

02:03:49.718 --> 02:03:50.988
Did you misplace the order?

02:03:51.118 --> 02:03:53.018
No, ma'am,
I brought what she asked for.

02:03:53.128 --> 02:03:55.318
But it tastes different.

02:03:55.558 --> 02:03:57.498
Yes, ma'am,
it is a mixture of raw fruits.

02:03:57.558 --> 02:03:59.128
You said that
you didn't want sugar.

02:03:59.278 --> 02:04:01.698
So, it tastes different.
- Oh.

02:04:03.238 --> 02:04:04.048
Thank you, ma'am.

02:04:05.838 --> 02:04:07.578
Reena, we can change it
if you don't want it.

02:04:07.838 --> 02:04:09.038
No, Manasa, it's okay.

02:04:09.738 --> 02:04:10.568
Are you sure?

02:04:10.718 --> 02:04:11.498
Yes.

02:04:34.538 --> 02:04:35.528
Manasa.

02:04:37.718 --> 02:04:39.598
I feel weird
after drinking this juice.

02:04:40.918 --> 02:04:42.358
We are working restlessly.

02:04:42.658 --> 02:04:43.838
You might be dehydrated.

02:04:44.038 --> 02:04:46.938
Shall we have another drink?
- No, this is enough.

02:04:47.298 --> 02:04:49.558
It is just fruit juice.

02:04:50.068 --> 02:04:51.638
Drink it. It will be good for you.

02:04:53.118 --> 02:04:54.138
Excuse me.

02:06:07.448 --> 02:06:08.538
What happened, Reena?

02:06:11.138 --> 02:06:13.818
I don't know, Manasa.
I am feeling dizzy.

02:06:14.038 --> 02:06:15.128
Oh, wait.

02:06:17.918 --> 02:06:18.898
Are you okay?

02:06:20.368 --> 02:06:22.098
I am okay.

02:06:26.638 --> 02:06:28.428
Reena, where are you going?

02:06:28.668 --> 02:06:31.488
No, Manasa. I have
some work in the hospital.

02:06:31.888 --> 02:06:34.188
I have to go home after that.
- Are you leaving?

02:06:34.698 --> 02:06:35.708
Bye, Manasa.

02:06:36.088 --> 02:06:37.028
R-Reena..

02:06:53.968 --> 02:06:56.308
Sir, the next project is with you.

02:06:56.398 --> 02:06:58.508
This project
is very important for us.

02:06:58.538 --> 02:06:59.338
All the best.

02:06:59.508 --> 02:07:00.298
Do it well.

02:07:00.378 --> 02:07:01.498
Okay.
- Thank you so much.

02:07:01.758 --> 02:07:04.268
Arjun, take care.
I am leaving.

02:07:04.478 --> 02:07:05.348
Why, Reena?

02:07:07.488 --> 02:07:08.578
Why do you look weird?

02:07:08.698 --> 02:07:11.288
No, I feel dizzy.

02:07:11.878 --> 02:07:13.548
Shall I get you some medicine?

02:07:13.678 --> 02:07:14.698
No, Arjun.

02:07:14.748 --> 02:07:16.538
I will be fine when I go out.

02:07:16.958 --> 02:07:18.418
I have some work in the hospital.

02:07:18.478 --> 02:07:19.478
I am leaving.

02:07:20.568 --> 02:07:22.768
You can manage, right?
Shall I book a cab? - No.

02:07:23.338 --> 02:07:25.138
I will take care. Bye.

02:07:26.718 --> 02:07:27.698
Hi, Arjun.

02:07:54.918 --> 02:07:57.628
Guys, my friend and I
met with an accident.

02:07:57.718 --> 02:07:58.788
Don't worry.

02:07:58.878 --> 02:08:00.498
I am not seriously injured.

02:08:00.568 --> 02:08:01.958
It's just a small scratch.

02:08:02.018 --> 02:08:04.508
But my friend was severely injured.

02:08:04.598 --> 02:08:07.818
Where are we now?
We are at RK Hospital.

02:08:08.388 --> 02:08:09.588
Can you see?

02:08:09.638 --> 02:08:11.248
This is the emergency ward.

02:08:11.298 --> 02:08:12.948
Come, I will show you my friend.

02:08:12.998 --> 02:08:13.958
Buddy!

02:08:14.248 --> 02:08:16.338
Buddy, why are you shivering?

02:08:17.208 --> 02:08:18.758
Just a minute. Look at my friend.

02:08:19.358 --> 02:08:21.678
Buddy! Say hi.

02:08:22.068 --> 02:08:24.648
Keep quiet. It's paining.

02:08:24.718 --> 02:08:27.048
Our viewers are watching us.

02:08:27.208 --> 02:08:28.298
Just a minute.

02:08:28.348 --> 02:08:29.478
He will smile now.

02:08:30.088 --> 02:08:31.718
What are you doing?

02:08:31.868 --> 02:08:34.408
You should not use your phone here,
and you are taking videos.

02:08:34.538 --> 02:08:35.438
Turn it off.

02:08:36.478 --> 02:08:41.568
Guys, can you see how strict
the staff at RK Hospital is?

02:08:51.008 --> 02:08:52.278
Guys, just a minute.

02:08:52.358 --> 02:08:54.188
Ma'am, if I post this video

02:08:54.398 --> 02:08:56.248
your hospital
will get free promotion, right?

02:08:56.318 --> 02:08:57.488
No need for that.

02:08:57.548 --> 02:08:59.428
I am telling you. Turn it off.

02:08:59.958 --> 02:09:02.148
Ma'am, please listen to me.

02:09:02.228 --> 02:09:04.518
My stomach is hurting.

02:09:05.008 --> 02:09:07.508
Doctor, please do something.

02:09:07.638 --> 02:09:08.658
Oh, no!

02:09:09.068 --> 02:09:10.198
It's burning.

02:09:10.318 --> 02:09:11.718
What happened?
- Doctor!

02:09:11.768 --> 02:09:14.278
He has got severe stomach pain.
- Doctor! It's paining.

02:09:14.808 --> 02:09:16.808
Doctor, do something.

02:09:18.368 --> 02:09:21.428
Prepare the PPE.
- Okay, Doctor. - Make it fast.

02:09:23.438 --> 02:09:24.738
It's paining.

02:09:30.198 --> 02:09:31.798
Ma'am, take this.

02:09:32.508 --> 02:09:34.608
Oh, no..

02:09:34.938 --> 02:09:36.188
Oh, no.

02:09:36.388 --> 02:09:38.008
It's paining.
- Take this.

02:09:45.078 --> 02:09:46.408
Take care of him.
- It hurts!

02:10:14.918 --> 02:10:15.758
Guys!

02:10:16.358 --> 02:10:17.478
Look there.

02:10:27.568 --> 02:10:29.728
Reena, the patient is crashing.
What are you doing?

02:10:30.458 --> 02:10:31.648
Guna!

02:10:32.678 --> 02:10:33.688
Move aside.

02:10:37.608 --> 02:10:38.628
What did you give him?

02:10:39.558 --> 02:10:41.768
Stomach pain.. PPE.

02:10:43.408 --> 02:10:44.698
Nurse..
Nurse..

02:10:45.478 --> 02:10:47.298
Doctor?
- Bring the Avil and Dex quickly.

02:10:47.398 --> 02:10:48.288
Okay, Doctor.

02:10:49.758 --> 02:10:50.728
Hey, come here.

02:10:53.238 --> 02:10:55.548
Why did you treat him
when you are drunk?

02:10:56.278 --> 02:10:57.958
I didn't drink, Guna.

02:10:58.278 --> 02:11:00.498
I just feel dizzy.

02:11:01.278 --> 02:11:03.788
I can smell alcohol on you.

02:11:05.558 --> 02:11:07.648
You didn't even see that
there are rashes on his body.

02:11:07.908 --> 02:11:09.378
You didn't know
his allergic reactions

02:11:09.428 --> 02:11:10.608
and yet you gave him medication.

02:11:11.208 --> 02:11:12.668
He is very critical because of you.

02:11:12.808 --> 02:11:13.778
Do you know that?

02:11:52.738 --> 02:11:55.668
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

02:11:57.728 --> 02:12:00.118
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

02:12:02.758 --> 02:12:05.628
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

02:12:07.398 --> 02:12:09.768
♪ Our patience wins ♪

02:12:09.918 --> 02:12:12.358
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

02:12:12.468 --> 02:12:15.008
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

02:12:15.178 --> 02:12:17.728
♪ I am a doctor ♪

02:12:20.138 --> 02:12:23.128
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

02:12:41.934 --> 02:12:44.934
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

02:12:46.974 --> 02:12:49.604
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

02:12:52.104 --> 02:12:54.894
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

02:12:56.724 --> 02:12:59.164
♪ Our patience wins ♪

02:12:59.264 --> 02:13:01.694
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

02:13:01.764 --> 02:13:04.514
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

02:13:04.564 --> 02:13:07.024
♪ I am a doctor ♪

02:13:09.434 --> 02:13:12.564
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

02:13:14.474 --> 02:13:16.974
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

02:13:19.264 --> 02:13:23.894
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

02:13:36.184 --> 02:13:37.474
Doctor, injection.

02:13:37.764 --> 02:13:39.394
You go, I will take care.
- Okay, Doctor.

02:14:03.224 --> 02:14:04.184
What happened?

02:14:06.764 --> 02:14:08.064
She is not steady, Teju.

02:14:09.564 --> 02:14:10.854
Without checking the patient

02:14:10.924 --> 02:14:12.314
she has administered
the wrong medication.

02:14:13.024 --> 02:14:14.724
What would've happened
if I hadn't come on time?

02:14:14.814 --> 02:14:16.434
You should have called
the duty doctors.

02:14:17.434 --> 02:14:18.854
Who asked you to do all this?

02:14:19.474 --> 02:14:20.354
Guna.

02:14:21.854 --> 02:14:23.024
I didn't drink.

02:14:25.394 --> 02:14:26.224
Come here.

02:14:31.644 --> 02:14:32.604
Reena.

02:14:32.934 --> 02:14:34.724
Do you know
how big an offence this is?

02:14:35.414 --> 02:14:36.814
You will be done for
if you get caught.

02:14:37.264 --> 02:14:38.354
Why did you come to work drunk?

02:14:38.684 --> 02:14:39.684
Teju.

02:14:40.144 --> 02:14:41.434
I didn't drink.

02:14:42.224 --> 02:14:44.354
I just had a fruit mocktail.

02:14:46.064 --> 02:14:47.434
The patient is stable now.

02:14:47.714 --> 02:14:49.644
His symptoms will get better.

02:14:51.934 --> 02:14:55.724
Teju, take his rotary investigation
and allergy panel.

02:14:56.074 --> 02:15:00.314
From food to medicine,
note down all his allergies.

02:15:01.264 --> 02:15:02.184
Okay.

02:15:03.144 --> 02:15:04.414
Wait, I will book a cab for you.

02:15:04.574 --> 02:15:05.434
No..

02:15:05.734 --> 02:15:06.724
I will go.

02:15:06.974 --> 02:15:08.354
Where is my bag?

02:15:08.894 --> 02:15:09.814
Phone..

02:15:10.774 --> 02:15:11.854
Where did you keep it?

02:15:12.064 --> 02:15:14.434
I kept it somewhere here.
It is missing.

02:15:14.684 --> 02:15:15.604
Wait, I will check.

02:15:15.934 --> 02:15:17.684
Wait..
- Teju.

02:15:19.854 --> 02:15:23.024
No one should know
what happened here.

02:15:23.524 --> 02:15:24.524
Do you understand?

02:15:26.024 --> 02:15:26.854
Okay.

02:16:20.524 --> 02:16:21.394
Hello.

02:16:21.484 --> 02:16:23.184
Reena, why didn't you
answer my calls?

02:16:23.304 --> 02:16:26.224
What happened? Why has everyone
called me so many times?

02:16:26.894 --> 02:16:29.524
I've got so many messages.
What is that link about?

02:16:30.564 --> 02:16:31.564
Why did you send them to me?

02:16:31.604 --> 02:16:33.564
Why did you treat the patient
when you were drunk?

02:16:33.934 --> 02:16:35.184
Oh, God, Guna!

02:16:35.724 --> 02:16:38.814
I didn't drink alcohol.
It was just a mocktail.

02:16:38.944 --> 02:16:39.904
Alcohol free.

02:16:40.434 --> 02:16:41.354
What happened?

02:16:41.464 --> 02:16:43.724
You treated the patient
when you were drunk, right?

02:16:44.364 --> 02:16:46.394
There was a student who
came with a patient in the ER

02:16:46.644 --> 02:16:48.524
and he has uploaded
a video for his vlog.

02:16:48.624 --> 02:16:50.974
It is trending now
on social media and the internet.

02:16:51.464 --> 02:16:53.024
It has become a big problem.

02:16:53.684 --> 02:16:55.144
You come to the hospital first.

02:17:05.934 --> 02:17:06.824
We'll deal with it.

02:17:06.874 --> 02:17:08.764
I've to pick up my kid from school.

02:17:09.264 --> 02:17:12.574
This is the alcoholic doctor, right?
- Yes.

02:17:12.624 --> 02:17:14.624
She did all that while being drunk.

02:17:15.474 --> 02:17:18.434
She is the one who treated
a patient while being drunk.

02:17:18.584 --> 02:17:20.854
What if something
had happened to the patient?

02:17:22.934 --> 02:17:23.894
Reena.

02:17:25.474 --> 02:17:26.314
Arjun.

02:17:27.394 --> 02:17:28.764
What happened last night, Reena?

02:17:29.644 --> 02:17:31.644
Why did you treat the patient
when you were not steady?

02:17:31.934 --> 02:17:33.934
I don't know
what happened to me, Arjun.

02:17:34.924 --> 02:17:37.264
I felt dizzy, that's all.

02:17:39.894 --> 02:17:42.724
I should have asked you to go home
when you said you were feeling sick.

02:17:43.224 --> 02:17:44.224
No, Arjun.

02:17:44.444 --> 02:17:46.664
I had to work on a file,
that's why I came here.

02:17:47.064 --> 02:17:49.984
But there was
an emergency case at that time.

02:17:50.434 --> 02:17:53.264
I treated the patient because
there were no other doctors.

02:17:54.524 --> 02:17:55.434
Arjun.

02:17:56.564 --> 02:17:58.524
I didn't drink any alcohol, Arjun.

02:18:00.224 --> 02:18:02.854
I don't even know what
being drunk feels like, Arjun.

02:18:05.494 --> 02:18:06.814
What will happen after this?

02:18:08.394 --> 02:18:10.464
They have asked everyone to
come for an emergency meeting.

02:18:11.854 --> 02:18:13.744
The chief doctor,
senior doctors and I

02:18:13.794 --> 02:18:15.684
should analyse this
situation together

02:18:16.564 --> 02:18:19.644
and take a decision
on how to handle this further.

02:18:27.524 --> 02:18:29.564
I don't know
how this is going to end.

02:18:43.814 --> 02:18:46.974
We need responsibility
as a senior doctor.

02:18:47.104 --> 02:18:48.014
How can she do this?

02:18:48.114 --> 02:18:50.144
She should be
an example to everyone.

02:18:50.314 --> 02:18:51.734
How can she be a bad example?

02:18:51.854 --> 02:18:52.764
What do you say?

02:18:52.854 --> 02:18:53.684
What?

02:18:56.314 --> 02:18:57.524
W-Welcome, Reena.

02:19:00.564 --> 02:19:01.854
Did you sign this, Teju?

02:19:05.724 --> 02:19:06.604
Teju.

02:19:07.104 --> 02:19:07.974
Hey.

02:19:08.354 --> 02:19:09.524
What are you thinking about?

02:19:10.394 --> 02:19:11.224
Well..

02:19:12.424 --> 02:19:15.394
Reena doesn't drink
even when she is compelled to.

02:19:16.974 --> 02:19:17.974
Then how?

02:19:19.264 --> 02:19:20.524
Something is wrong.

02:19:22.024 --> 02:19:22.894
Maybe..

02:19:23.394 --> 02:19:24.934
What if she had drunk it without
knowing that it was alcohol?

02:19:25.684 --> 02:19:26.564
Hey.

02:19:26.854 --> 02:19:27.854
How is that possible?

02:19:28.474 --> 02:19:31.354
Wouldn't she even know whether her
drink was alcoholic or non-alcoholic?

02:19:34.814 --> 02:19:36.434
Even if she had drunk it

02:19:37.644 --> 02:19:39.974
she would have known
if she was steady or not.

02:19:41.544 --> 02:19:42.724
That is also correct.

02:19:43.004 --> 02:19:47.184
But she wouldn't have known
that alcohol was the reason for it.

02:19:47.934 --> 02:19:49.814
According to her,
it was fruit juice.

02:19:50.064 --> 02:19:53.764
She would have thought
that she was just dizzy.

02:19:53.954 --> 02:19:54.934
There is a chance.

02:19:57.544 --> 02:20:00.024
Something must have
happened at the party.

02:20:08.354 --> 02:20:10.224
Teju, I will be back in a minute.

02:20:20.854 --> 02:20:21.724
Hey.

02:20:22.894 --> 02:20:23.724
Hey.

02:20:24.064 --> 02:20:28.064
Will you come to me whenever
there is a problem in the hospital?

02:20:28.314 --> 02:20:31.354
Just tell me that you are not
involved in Reena's issue.

02:20:32.844 --> 02:20:35.264
Will you believe me if I tell you so?
But that is the truth.

02:20:35.934 --> 02:20:39.104
I am not involved
in Reena's issue in any way.

02:20:43.584 --> 02:20:44.434
But..

02:20:45.524 --> 02:20:48.394
I mixed alcohol in her drink
without her knowledge.

02:20:49.564 --> 02:20:50.524
Hey..

02:20:50.974 --> 02:20:52.524
That patient would have died.

02:20:53.064 --> 02:20:56.434
How can you act so casual after
doing such a disgusting thing?

02:20:56.604 --> 02:20:57.434
Hey.

02:20:57.564 --> 02:20:59.314
I didn't make her drink
alcohol knowing that

02:20:59.394 --> 02:21:01.404
she would come to the hospital
straight from the party.

02:21:03.564 --> 02:21:04.644
Look here, Manasa.

02:21:05.064 --> 02:21:06.644
I had a little respect for you.

02:21:07.524 --> 02:21:08.474
Do you know why?

02:21:08.764 --> 02:21:10.854
Even if you behave selfishly

02:21:11.314 --> 02:21:13.684
I believed that you won't
put a patient's life at stake.

02:21:14.164 --> 02:21:15.064
Darn.

02:21:15.944 --> 02:21:16.934
Look here, Naveen.

02:21:17.084 --> 02:21:21.104
If Reena drinks at the party,
she'd do something to impress Arjun.

02:21:21.404 --> 02:21:23.354
Then Arjun would
get angry with her.

02:21:23.444 --> 02:21:25.934
I did all this to create
a distance between them.

02:21:26.154 --> 02:21:29.434
But I didn't expect that she would
come here and treat a patient.

02:21:29.764 --> 02:21:30.764
Hey.. Darn it.

02:21:30.894 --> 02:21:33.104
Don't just try to justify it.
- Hey, Naveen.

02:21:33.384 --> 02:21:34.764
You are not supporting me.

02:21:34.934 --> 02:21:36.764
At least,
you can believe what I say.

02:21:37.044 --> 02:21:39.354
The consequences of what you did
are happening now.

02:21:39.524 --> 02:21:40.474
Look here.

02:21:40.664 --> 02:21:42.024
There is an emergency
meeting going on.

02:21:42.434 --> 02:21:46.064
If I come to know that there is
some problem for Reena's job

02:21:48.064 --> 02:21:49.814
I will do anything to save her.

02:21:53.354 --> 02:21:54.854
Reena is more important
to me than you.

02:21:55.464 --> 02:21:56.434
Keep that in mind.

02:22:13.394 --> 02:22:14.314
Grandpa.

02:22:14.604 --> 02:22:17.604
Reena has created
a problem in the hospital.

02:22:17.684 --> 02:22:18.814
Did you know that?

02:22:18.934 --> 02:22:21.354
Everyone was talking
about it in school.

02:22:22.764 --> 02:22:28.104
It's all over the news,
be it on the phone or on TV.

02:22:28.934 --> 02:22:31.944
To put it in your language,
it is trending now.

02:22:32.384 --> 02:22:33.764
Poor Reena.

02:22:35.854 --> 02:22:38.024
I can't understand
the kids these days.

02:22:38.934 --> 02:22:39.894
Grandpa.

02:22:40.104 --> 02:22:42.474
Do you think that Reena
would have done something wrong?

02:22:42.974 --> 02:22:44.024
I don't know.

02:22:44.664 --> 02:22:48.144
I'm not sure what is true
and what is false.

02:22:48.484 --> 02:22:50.224
Are we like others?

02:22:50.394 --> 02:22:52.104
We know Reena better.

02:22:52.144 --> 02:22:54.184
We should be supportive of her.

02:22:54.304 --> 02:22:55.644
We should believe her.

02:22:55.704 --> 02:22:58.894
I strongly believe that Reena
wouldn't have done any mistake.

02:23:02.394 --> 02:23:04.064
What is Reena doing now?

02:23:04.564 --> 02:23:06.104
What is happening in the hospital?

02:23:06.854 --> 02:23:09.314
We are sitting here
without knowing anything.

02:23:11.724 --> 02:23:13.764
I spoke in haste.

02:23:14.104 --> 02:23:16.474
She must have felt bad.

02:23:17.064 --> 02:23:18.894
I didn't say it on purpose.

02:23:34.894 --> 02:23:35.814
Reena.

02:23:38.894 --> 02:23:41.264
I didn't do it on purpose, Teju.

02:23:44.264 --> 02:23:47.024
No one here believes me, Teju.

02:23:48.604 --> 02:23:51.604
Even my colleagues doubt me.

02:23:51.644 --> 02:23:52.934
I didn't do it, Teju.

02:23:54.064 --> 02:23:57.064
You said that you
drank only a fruit mock-tail.

02:23:58.144 --> 02:24:00.434
Didn't you know what you drank?

02:24:02.474 --> 02:24:06.564
I asked the waiter
why the taste was different.

02:24:07.644 --> 02:24:10.124
He said that it was raw fruit

02:24:10.164 --> 02:24:13.684
and that it'd taste
like that without sugar.

02:24:16.024 --> 02:24:19.434
I came to the hospital
to work on a file.

02:24:20.024 --> 02:24:22.104
I didn't come here
to treat patients.

02:24:22.854 --> 02:24:26.354
Even Guna came after some time.

02:24:26.394 --> 02:24:28.684
That's why I treated the patient.

02:24:31.184 --> 02:24:35.604
Only after Guna told me did I come
to know that I was drunk.

02:24:36.644 --> 02:24:40.934
I assumed it was just
regular dizziness until then.

02:24:41.184 --> 02:24:42.184
I didn't do it.

02:24:45.564 --> 02:24:47.434
What are they going
to do now, Teju?

02:24:48.564 --> 02:24:51.264
The meeting is still going on.

02:24:51.934 --> 02:24:56.564
I'm scared that I might lose
my job because of this problem.

02:24:57.444 --> 02:25:01.314
You know that I've struggled
a lot to reach here.

02:25:02.524 --> 02:25:06.184
I wouldn't do anything
to jeopardise it, Teju.

02:25:08.894 --> 02:25:12.434
How am I going to explain it
to the people here?

02:25:13.324 --> 02:25:14.184
Look here.

02:25:14.854 --> 02:25:15.684
Look here.

02:25:15.934 --> 02:25:17.524
Nothing will happen as you think.

02:25:17.934 --> 02:25:19.184
Dr. Radhi is here.

02:25:20.354 --> 02:25:21.314
She'll take care of it.

02:25:23.314 --> 02:25:24.684
She won't leave you like that.

02:25:26.974 --> 02:25:27.814
Don't cry.

02:25:35.144 --> 02:25:37.354
We need to analyse
the situation, Vijay.

02:25:37.934 --> 02:25:38.854
Come, Arjun.

02:25:40.324 --> 02:25:42.644
It's right to decide after
analysing the situation.

02:25:42.684 --> 02:25:45.184
But I think Reena
deserves a second chance.

02:25:45.384 --> 02:25:47.224
Let's warn her this time.

02:25:49.264 --> 02:25:50.894
What Reena did
was negligence, Vijay.

02:25:50.974 --> 02:25:52.264
How can you ask
for a second chance?

02:25:53.524 --> 02:25:56.104
You know that
it's not enough just to warn her.

02:25:56.684 --> 02:25:58.814
Ma'am, you were there
at the meeting.

02:25:59.394 --> 02:26:01.644
All our doctors supported Reena.

02:26:02.064 --> 02:26:02.974
That's right.

02:26:03.594 --> 02:26:05.224
But you should decide
as the chief doctor.

02:26:05.724 --> 02:26:06.894
You tell me what to do.

02:26:08.604 --> 02:26:09.934
What have you decided, ma'am?

02:26:11.524 --> 02:26:12.854
We need to suspend Reena.

02:26:15.194 --> 02:26:16.314
Suspend?

02:26:17.434 --> 02:26:19.104
What kind of logic is this, Radhi?

02:26:20.144 --> 02:26:22.854
Radhi, you decided to give
a warning in Amaya's case.

02:26:23.314 --> 02:26:26.644
Dr. Preetham's insistence led
to the one-month suspension.

02:26:26.814 --> 02:26:31.024
You are the one who reduced it
to three weeks at her request.

02:26:31.064 --> 02:26:33.224
On top of that,
what Amaya did was a crime.

02:26:33.854 --> 02:26:37.524
You made Nilofer apologise
so it wouldn't become a legal case.

02:26:38.334 --> 02:26:40.314
But why are you
so harsh in Reena's case?

02:26:40.474 --> 02:26:43.314
Vijay their case
and Reena's case are different.

02:26:44.024 --> 02:26:45.474
That's what I'm asking.

02:26:45.854 --> 02:26:48.974
Amaya's case and Nilofer's case
should have been a legal issue.

02:26:49.144 --> 02:26:51.764
But you made sure to save them.

02:26:52.224 --> 02:26:56.184
In Reena's case, the patient or
the visitors didn't file a complaint.

02:26:56.854 --> 02:26:57.814
Radhi..

02:26:58.854 --> 02:27:01.314
I feel it's wrong to take this
decision regarding Reena.

02:27:02.564 --> 02:27:05.104
As he said, even I feel it's
wrong to suspend Reena.

02:27:06.144 --> 02:27:09.024
Arjun, I've thought it
through and decided.

02:27:10.644 --> 02:27:13.264
And Vijay, I didn't take
a biased decision.

02:27:13.604 --> 02:27:17.024
Even if there is no complaint against
Reena, there's solid evidence.

02:27:17.314 --> 02:27:19.224
It's circulating all over
the media and news channels.

02:27:19.814 --> 02:27:24.104
If we don't take the right decision
now, it will affect our hospital.

02:27:24.354 --> 02:27:29.064
No matter how correct we are,
they will portray us wrongly.

02:27:30.894 --> 02:27:33.024
Headlines come and go, Radhi.

02:27:32.144 --> 02:28:02.144
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

02:27:33.854 --> 02:27:35.524
Today, it's our hospital.
Tomorrow, it will be another.

02:27:35.634 --> 02:27:36.974
Everyone will forget it.

02:27:37.654 --> 02:27:40.354
We can't take
a decision just like that.

02:27:41.064 --> 02:27:43.014
Our hospital's reputation
is important.

02:27:49.394 --> 02:27:52.474
If this is your decision,
I'll stand by it, but..

02:27:54.314 --> 02:27:56.264
I don't like your decision.

02:28:03.724 --> 02:28:05.484
It's not fair
to do this to Reena, ma'am.

02:28:08.104 --> 02:28:11.854
Arjun, let Reena be away
for a few days.

02:28:12.644 --> 02:28:14.934
Meanwhile, I need
to figure out some things.

02:28:15.354 --> 02:28:17.934
Why should Reena go away
for you to figure things out?

02:28:18.724 --> 02:28:19.974
Why should she suffer?

02:28:21.164 --> 02:28:23.684
I've taken this decision
so that she wouldn't suffer.

02:28:26.184 --> 02:28:27.394
I'm sorry to say this, ma'am.

02:28:27.804 --> 02:28:29.354
But I think your decision is wrong.

02:28:29.624 --> 02:28:30.604
One more thing.

02:28:30.974 --> 02:28:32.524
I don't know why you're doing this.

02:28:33.184 --> 02:28:35.524
If things are destined to unite,
it will surely happen.

02:28:36.974 --> 02:28:38.354
No matter who tries to stop it.

02:29:27.064 --> 02:29:27.974
You're suspended.

02:29:30.024 --> 02:29:31.064
Ma'am..

02:29:32.764 --> 02:29:33.644
Ma'am..

02:29:35.144 --> 02:29:36.104
Ma'am..

02:29:37.474 --> 02:29:39.564
I-I didn't do it, ma'am.

02:29:45.474 --> 02:29:46.394
Arjun.

02:29:46.734 --> 02:29:47.814
I didn't do it.

02:29:58.474 --> 02:30:00.764
I didn't do it, ma'am.

02:30:03.064 --> 02:30:04.764
I didn't do it.

02:30:11.394 --> 02:30:12.644
I didn't do it.

02:30:23.894 --> 02:30:24.764
Hey.

02:30:26.024 --> 02:30:27.184
I'll ask you something.

02:30:28.064 --> 02:30:29.434
But you have to tell me the truth.

02:30:31.974 --> 02:30:33.314
Your sister did it, right?

02:30:38.314 --> 02:30:40.394
You're so calm.

02:30:41.264 --> 02:30:42.974
So I think it is your sister
who did it.

02:30:48.314 --> 02:30:50.354
If you're so calm again,
I'll slap you.

02:30:51.604 --> 02:30:52.684
Tell me the truth.

02:30:52.934 --> 02:30:54.224
I know this look.

02:30:54.724 --> 02:30:56.524
Don't think that you can
hide anything from me.

02:30:57.234 --> 02:30:58.474
No, Teju.

02:30:58.854 --> 02:30:59.934
She didn't do it.

02:31:01.454 --> 02:31:02.354
I'll leave.

02:32:24.266 --> 02:32:27.566
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

02:32:29.226 --> 02:32:31.816
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

02:32:34.356 --> 02:32:37.476
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

02:32:39.016 --> 02:32:41.416
♪ Our patience wins ♪

02:32:41.506 --> 02:32:43.966
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

02:32:44.056 --> 02:32:46.776
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

02:32:46.836 --> 02:32:49.476
♪ I am a doctor ♪

02:32:51.726 --> 02:32:54.476
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

02:32:56.726 --> 02:32:59.646
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

02:33:01.566 --> 02:33:06.356
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

02:33:20.626 --> 02:33:21.586
Hi, Reena.

02:33:22.976 --> 02:33:24.146
What are you doing here?

02:33:25.936 --> 02:33:27.396
Come in,
why are you standing outside?

02:33:27.486 --> 02:33:28.356
Come in.

02:33:29.016 --> 02:33:29.916
Go.

02:33:35.146 --> 02:33:36.106
How are you, sir?

02:33:38.796 --> 02:33:39.716
I am fine.

02:33:42.356 --> 02:33:45.816
I came to know
about your suspension just today.

02:33:47.226 --> 02:33:48.066
Yes, Reena.

02:33:48.606 --> 02:33:51.016
Teju told me that you were
crying in the hospital yesterday.

02:33:52.056 --> 02:33:54.266
She was crying
all through the night as well.

02:33:55.146 --> 02:33:58.476
I know what I did was wrong.

02:34:00.646 --> 02:34:02.306
But I can't bear it.

02:34:03.726 --> 02:34:05.646
How long
is the suspension period, Reena?

02:34:06.356 --> 02:34:07.556
One month.

02:34:08.256 --> 02:34:10.716
It would have been a distraction
if she goes to work.

02:34:12.606 --> 02:34:15.476
What can she do if one bad
thing comes after another?

02:34:17.436 --> 02:34:18.316
Reena.

02:34:18.606 --> 02:34:20.056
I don't understand, Rocky.

02:34:21.276 --> 02:34:23.896
Amaya was suspended
only for a few weeks.

02:34:24.476 --> 02:34:27.276
But why is it a month for me?

02:34:30.186 --> 02:34:32.726
Dr. Vijay must be
the reason for all this.

02:34:33.816 --> 02:34:37.106
He didn't have a good opinion
about me since the beginning.

02:34:37.936 --> 02:34:42.066
He must've pushed for this suspension,
holding a grudge against me.

02:34:42.356 --> 02:34:43.396
No, Reena.

02:34:44.896 --> 02:34:46.726
We heard something else.

02:34:47.476 --> 02:34:48.436
What?

02:34:49.516 --> 02:34:52.316
Dr. Vijay didn't want you
to get suspended at all.

02:34:53.056 --> 02:34:54.976
He has even spoken a lot
for your sake.

02:34:55.456 --> 02:34:59.146
Arjun and the other doctors
have told not to suspend you.

02:35:01.146 --> 02:35:02.056
But..

02:35:02.266 --> 02:35:03.146
But?

02:35:04.396 --> 02:35:07.106
Dr. Radhi
insisted on suspending you.

02:35:08.766 --> 02:35:09.726
Dr. Radhi?

02:35:13.396 --> 02:35:14.816
Hey, Reena..

02:35:15.226 --> 02:35:16.976
Reena, don't cry.

02:35:18.966 --> 02:35:23.386
They might reduce the suspension
period once the issue settles down.

02:35:23.646 --> 02:35:24.706
Don't cry, Reena, please.

02:35:25.606 --> 02:35:27.606
Reena, why don't you
take this as some me-time?

02:35:28.226 --> 02:35:29.856
Spend time with Mr. Ganesh.

02:35:30.226 --> 02:35:31.816
Do whatever you want to do.

02:35:31.896 --> 02:35:33.476
You have time for all that, right?

02:35:38.516 --> 02:35:39.436
Come with me.

02:35:39.996 --> 02:35:40.836
Where?

02:35:41.056 --> 02:35:41.976
Come.

02:35:42.056 --> 02:35:43.146
Where, Reena?

02:35:44.476 --> 02:35:45.646
To Dr. Radhi's house.

02:35:46.686 --> 02:35:47.556
Hey!

02:35:47.976 --> 02:35:52.866
I meant that you can go to the beach
or do some recreational activities.

02:35:52.916 --> 02:35:54.026
I didn't mean this.

02:35:54.896 --> 02:35:56.106
Are you coming or not?

02:35:59.476 --> 02:36:00.356
No.
- No.

02:36:06.766 --> 02:36:07.606
What?

02:36:07.696 --> 02:36:09.426
You advise everyone at the hospital

02:36:09.636 --> 02:36:12.606
to avoid bringing personal issues
to work. Is it right what you did?

02:36:13.106 --> 02:36:14.006
What did I do?

02:36:14.056 --> 02:36:17.036
When no one supported
your decision to suspend me

02:36:17.356 --> 02:36:18.646
why did you suspend me?

02:36:20.646 --> 02:36:23.516
Why are you so desperate
to send me away from this hospital?

02:36:24.196 --> 02:36:25.366
Who told you all this?

02:36:25.866 --> 02:36:28.856
Ma'am, I didn't say that I saw it.
I said I just heard it.

02:36:29.476 --> 02:36:30.746
Why are you glaring at them?

02:36:31.606 --> 02:36:33.226
Only you took this decision, right?

02:36:34.816 --> 02:36:35.716
Yes.

02:36:36.366 --> 02:36:37.816
I took this decision.

02:36:38.406 --> 02:36:39.226
Why?

02:36:39.646 --> 02:36:41.276
I am not saying that
what I did was right.

02:36:41.316 --> 02:36:43.186
But did I make a bigger
mistake than Amaya?

02:36:43.476 --> 02:36:45.846
Even Teju said that
you will take care of it.

02:36:45.976 --> 02:36:48.836
Even now, I said that Dr. Vijay
would have been the reason..

02:36:48.876 --> 02:36:50.726
Listen to me.
- Would you do this to others?

02:36:50.766 --> 02:36:52.316
You are doing this because it's me.
- Reena..

02:36:52.396 --> 02:36:53.396
Reena!

02:36:58.926 --> 02:36:59.726
You are right.

02:36:59.856 --> 02:37:01.556
I am talking like this
because it's you.

02:37:02.936 --> 02:37:05.086
There is solid
evidence against you.

02:37:05.896 --> 02:37:07.226
If I don't take this decision now

02:37:07.266 --> 02:37:10.146
they'll say I was biased
because you're my daughter.

02:37:10.366 --> 02:37:11.546
This is medical negligence.

02:37:11.646 --> 02:37:13.516
This shouldn't happen
in this hospital anymore.

02:37:13.686 --> 02:37:15.806
Everyone should know
what will happen if it does.

02:37:16.476 --> 02:37:18.816
It is better for you to stay
away from this hospital for now.

02:37:18.896 --> 02:37:20.146
Take some space.

02:37:20.686 --> 02:37:22.926
Who are you to tell me what
I should do and what I shouldn't?

02:37:23.856 --> 02:37:26.516
I know what is right for me.
You don't have to advise me.

02:37:26.976 --> 02:37:28.426
You have done enough!

02:37:29.316 --> 02:37:30.396
Reena..
- Hey..

02:37:31.056 --> 02:37:32.056
Reena, wait.

02:37:41.976 --> 02:37:42.906
What is it, Mr. Kamal?

02:37:43.106 --> 02:37:44.506
You seem to be
thinking about something.

02:37:44.686 --> 02:37:45.936
It is about Reena.

02:37:46.806 --> 02:37:49.436
I never thought
that they would suspend her.

02:37:49.856 --> 02:37:50.756
Me neither.

02:37:51.106 --> 02:37:53.396
But they didn't even ask
Reena what happened.

02:37:54.226 --> 02:37:56.396
That college boy
has recorded everything.

02:37:57.156 --> 02:38:01.896
No, I think the recent issues
at the hospital made them stricter.

02:38:02.606 --> 02:38:03.426
Yes, guys.

02:38:03.506 --> 02:38:05.876
Be very careful with your work.
- You're right. - Doctor.

02:38:05.926 --> 02:38:07.696
Three of you should come
to the ER immediately.

02:38:07.816 --> 02:38:09.146
Come on, it is an emergency.

02:38:13.106 --> 02:38:14.476
Is she still in pain?

02:38:15.026 --> 02:38:17.726
Nilofer, check her BP.
- I will locate the area of pain.

02:38:17.866 --> 02:38:19.016
Does it hurt here?

02:38:19.126 --> 02:38:20.816
Here?
- What is the case?

02:38:22.146 --> 02:38:23.856
She has a stomach-ache,
I think it is gastritis.

02:38:24.316 --> 02:38:26.106
The pain doesn't look
like it is gastritis.

02:38:26.726 --> 02:38:27.926
It looks like appendicitis.

02:38:27.976 --> 02:38:28.816
Just a minute.

02:38:30.646 --> 02:38:33.026
Tell me if it hurts.
- It hurts a lot.

02:38:33.806 --> 02:38:34.936
It hurts a lot, Doctor.

02:38:35.016 --> 02:38:36.856
The right iliac feels tender.

02:38:37.766 --> 02:38:39.186
Proceed with the scan.

02:38:40.016 --> 02:38:40.976
And Kiran.

02:38:41.246 --> 02:38:42.476
Give her some painkillers.

02:38:44.186 --> 02:38:44.976
Ma'am.

02:38:45.266 --> 02:38:47.186
I have asked them to give
medication for your pain.

02:38:47.436 --> 02:38:49.436
Bear it for some time.
- It hurts a lot.

02:38:51.556 --> 02:38:52.606
Kiran, what is it?

02:38:54.476 --> 02:38:56.966
Guna, don't mistake me.

02:38:57.176 --> 02:38:58.726
We saw the case first.

02:38:59.036 --> 02:39:00.606
But you took it over.

02:39:01.006 --> 02:39:01.856
This is wrong.

02:39:01.966 --> 02:39:04.436
You always take over
the patients we attend.

02:39:04.506 --> 02:39:05.606
It is not fair, Guna.

02:39:05.966 --> 02:39:07.396
This is not
the time to argue, Kiran.

02:39:07.516 --> 02:39:08.536
Bring the painkillers.

02:39:09.306 --> 02:39:11.476
Guna, we are saying
that she is our patient.

02:39:12.266 --> 02:39:13.186
Hey.

02:39:13.426 --> 02:39:14.226
What is this?

02:39:14.396 --> 02:39:15.356
What are you doing?

02:39:16.106 --> 02:39:17.726
You are arguing
in front of the patient.

02:39:17.916 --> 02:39:19.566
Teju, we saw the case first.

02:39:19.766 --> 02:39:21.166
But he took over.

02:39:21.376 --> 02:39:22.566
This is not the first time.

02:39:22.646 --> 02:39:24.576
He always does this.
- Seriously.

02:39:25.356 --> 02:39:26.856
Guys, this is not the time
to discuss. - It hurts a lot!

02:39:26.896 --> 02:39:29.436
Can you treat me
instead of arguing? Please.

02:39:29.546 --> 02:39:32.016
Okay, let's say that it's a problem.
You can argue later.

02:39:32.106 --> 02:39:33.076
Treat the patient first.

02:39:33.246 --> 02:39:34.726
Teju, you are also an intern.

02:39:34.936 --> 02:39:36.816
You should support us.
- Hey.

02:39:36.896 --> 02:39:37.896
You may get cases.

02:39:38.106 --> 02:39:39.496
But you are not a resident.

02:39:40.186 --> 02:39:41.006
Teju.

02:39:41.116 --> 02:39:43.346
Nilofer and Kamal got a chance
to assist in the surgery.

02:39:43.646 --> 02:39:44.816
But I didn't get one.

02:39:45.396 --> 02:39:47.726
Okay, we can discuss it later
with Dr. Radhi.

02:39:48.066 --> 02:39:50.016
First, proceed with the scan
for the patient.

02:39:50.606 --> 02:39:52.766
I can't bear it, it's paining.

02:39:52.896 --> 02:39:54.326
I will ask them
to give you medicine.

02:39:57.436 --> 02:39:58.436
It will be fine.

02:40:09.556 --> 02:40:11.516
Why are you arguing
in front of a patient in the ER?

02:40:11.616 --> 02:40:12.566
Ma'am.

02:40:12.616 --> 02:40:14.606
Residents take over all the cases.

02:40:14.966 --> 02:40:17.016
We can't even do a basic procedure.

02:40:17.226 --> 02:40:19.226
We saw the patient first.

02:40:19.686 --> 02:40:22.226
But Guna took over the patient.

02:40:23.106 --> 02:40:24.896
Don't we know
what to assign for the interns?

02:40:25.206 --> 02:40:27.706
Ma'am, when Guna
and Reena were interns

02:40:27.766 --> 02:40:29.186
they got a lot of opportunities.

02:40:29.566 --> 02:40:32.486
But we don't even get
to do a basic procedure.

02:40:32.706 --> 02:40:35.316
We can gain experience
only if we get opportunities.

02:40:35.706 --> 02:40:38.976
Kiran, when we were interns,
we used to assist the residents.

02:40:39.066 --> 02:40:40.396
We got a lot of opportunities.

02:40:40.516 --> 02:40:41.526
That's right.

02:40:41.816 --> 02:40:43.516
But that was for our performance.

02:40:44.536 --> 02:40:46.646
We can perform only
if we get opportunities.

02:40:46.896 --> 02:40:47.976
Leave the performance aside.

02:40:48.166 --> 02:40:50.026
We can practice
only if we get opportunities.

02:40:51.406 --> 02:40:52.566
What do you want to do now?

02:40:52.806 --> 02:40:55.816
Ma'am, last time, you conducted
a competition among the interns.

02:40:56.266 --> 02:40:59.186
You gave the case to the person
who was diagnosed correctly.

02:40:59.476 --> 02:41:00.726
Instead of that

02:41:00.906 --> 02:41:02.956
we need your permission so that

02:41:03.006 --> 02:41:05.576
the first person to attend
to the patient gets to treat them.

02:41:06.076 --> 02:41:07.066
Nilofer.

02:41:07.396 --> 02:41:09.236
Do you know how many
risk factors there are?

02:41:09.606 --> 02:41:11.856
Teju, we are not doing it alone.

02:41:11.976 --> 02:41:14.016
Guna or any other senior

02:41:14.186 --> 02:41:16.066
can supervise us.
We are saying that we will do it.

02:41:16.136 --> 02:41:18.276
Stop it, guys.
What is this?

02:41:18.606 --> 02:41:21.006
Do you know how important
patience is for an internship?

02:41:22.366 --> 02:41:25.106
We can't let the interns
treat the patients just like that.

02:41:25.666 --> 02:41:28.026
You are asking for patients, right?

02:41:29.006 --> 02:41:31.856
What happened when I asked you
to assist in a surgery last time?

02:41:32.976 --> 02:41:34.516
You were so careless.

02:41:35.076 --> 02:41:38.576
If Dr. Vijay hadn't noticed, you'd
have closed up with the needle inside.

02:41:41.776 --> 02:41:44.226
First, understand
why I am making you observe.

02:41:44.386 --> 02:41:46.966
You can't just read the procedures
and treat the patients.

02:41:47.406 --> 02:41:50.276
How carefully you are
observing every patient

02:41:50.366 --> 02:41:53.936
and how calmly you are handling
the situation is equally important.

02:41:55.056 --> 02:41:57.016
Ma'am, with all due respect

02:41:57.556 --> 02:42:00.046
if the previous interns
had made a mistake

02:42:00.526 --> 02:42:03.396
you'd support them and give them
another opportunity.

02:42:03.966 --> 02:42:06.316
But for us..
- Enough, Nilofer.

02:42:06.476 --> 02:42:08.226
I am not doing a favour to anyone.

02:42:08.906 --> 02:42:11.026
Reena is in suspension
for the mistake she made.

02:42:13.856 --> 02:42:14.766
Okay.

02:42:15.506 --> 02:42:16.566
As you said

02:42:16.906 --> 02:42:19.816
let the first person to see
the patient attend to them.

02:42:20.966 --> 02:42:21.896
Ma'am..

02:42:22.686 --> 02:42:23.606
But one thing.

02:42:23.926 --> 02:42:25.486
There should be no mistake.
- There won't be, ma'am.

02:42:25.856 --> 02:42:26.726
Okay, ma'am.

02:42:26.776 --> 02:42:29.316
If any mistake happens, you saw
what happened to Reena, right?

02:42:31.356 --> 02:42:33.936
Whoever makes a mistake,
there is no warning.

02:42:34.876 --> 02:42:37.396
Whoever it is, they should
face the consequences.

02:42:42.016 --> 02:42:42.896
Now, leave.

02:42:43.396 --> 02:42:44.526
Thank you, ma'am.
- Thank you, ma'am.

02:42:46.856 --> 02:42:48.016
Teju and Guna, stay back.

02:42:54.106 --> 02:42:55.606
Why did you call for this meeting?

02:42:55.726 --> 02:42:56.606
I don't know, Vijay.

02:42:59.876 --> 02:43:01.726
There is a lot of media pressure
on the hospital, ma'am.

02:43:02.136 --> 02:43:03.526
We suspended Reena.

02:43:03.896 --> 02:43:06.186
But they are pressuring us
to dismiss her.

02:43:06.736 --> 02:43:07.776
Dismiss?

02:43:09.056 --> 02:43:10.726
Ma'am, she is already in grief.

02:43:10.916 --> 02:43:12.876
She couldn't even accept
the suspension.

02:43:13.936 --> 02:43:15.276
If you dismiss her now

02:43:15.666 --> 02:43:17.316
she can't bear it.
She will break down.

02:43:17.556 --> 02:43:19.146
Why are you telling me this, Rocky?

02:43:19.686 --> 02:43:21.516
Ma'am, you can do
something to help her.

02:43:21.976 --> 02:43:25.106
Ma'am, what Reena did was wrong.
I am not denying it.

02:43:25.196 --> 02:43:27.276
But Teju and I saved the patient.

02:43:27.726 --> 02:43:29.436
And the patient is
completely fine right now.

02:43:29.516 --> 02:43:30.686
Ma'am, not only that.

02:43:31.016 --> 02:43:32.576
You know how important
this job is to Reena

02:43:32.816 --> 02:43:35.316
and you know
why she chose this job.

02:43:36.676 --> 02:43:39.476
Teju, that is not relevant
in this situation.

02:43:39.806 --> 02:43:40.976
It is relevant, ma'am.

02:43:41.686 --> 02:43:43.556
Because this job is
very important to Reena.

02:43:44.106 --> 02:43:46.316
She has always been
supportive of everyone here.

02:43:46.776 --> 02:43:47.646
To us.

02:43:48.226 --> 02:43:49.226
To Arjun.

02:43:49.736 --> 02:43:51.436
Why, even to you.

02:43:52.506 --> 02:43:56.436
She has always been there for us,
whenever we needed her.

02:43:56.756 --> 02:43:58.146
Rocky, even now..

02:43:58.976 --> 02:44:01.816
It's not my decision
to dismiss her..

02:44:02.266 --> 02:44:03.196
Right, ma'am.

02:44:04.386 --> 02:44:06.226
But we shouldn't give up
on Reena, no matter what.

02:44:07.036 --> 02:44:09.896
Arjun, if we ask Radhi
whether it's Reena or this hospital

02:44:10.066 --> 02:44:12.066
she will definitely
support the hospital.

02:44:13.056 --> 02:44:14.016
Am I right, Radhi?

02:44:15.876 --> 02:44:17.626
We all know that Reena
doesn't drink, ma'am.

02:44:17.856 --> 02:44:19.816
She doesn't even know
what being drunk feels like.

02:44:20.156 --> 02:44:22.446
Ma'am, can we explain
this through a press meet?

02:44:23.006 --> 02:44:24.916
If not, there might be
another solution, ma'am.

02:44:25.016 --> 02:44:25.976
Let's think about it.

02:44:26.536 --> 02:44:29.086
Reena wasn't aware
of whatever happened there.

02:44:30.136 --> 02:44:32.356
I think it was someone else.

02:44:34.206 --> 02:44:38.896
But it's wrong of you to fire Reena
without investigating it, ma'am.

02:44:39.146 --> 02:44:40.646
No, Teju. I don't understand.

02:44:40.966 --> 02:44:43.106
Why are you all turning
this matter towards me?

02:44:43.976 --> 02:44:45.556
You are the one
who suspended her, Radhi.

02:44:46.276 --> 02:44:47.356
If you wanted

02:44:47.726 --> 02:44:49.266
you could have taken
a different decision.

02:44:49.436 --> 02:44:51.356
Vijay, what other
solution is there for this?

02:44:51.666 --> 02:44:52.566
Tell me.

02:44:54.086 --> 02:44:55.756
Considering the consequences

02:44:55.856 --> 02:44:58.226
we suspended Reena
to reduce the media pressure.

02:44:58.716 --> 02:45:01.186
But now, we are under
the same pressure to dismiss her.

02:45:01.356 --> 02:45:04.186
What other solution is there?
Tell me, I am all ears.

02:45:06.226 --> 02:45:08.996
'What can she do if one bad thing
happens after another?'

02:45:09.336 --> 02:45:10.886
'Would you have done this
to anyone else?'

02:45:11.066 --> 02:45:12.686
'You are doing this
because it's me.'

02:45:13.136 --> 02:45:15.436
'But they are pressuring us
to dismiss her.'

02:45:17.406 --> 02:45:19.726
'You took the decision,
would you do the same to others?'

02:45:19.796 --> 02:45:21.686
'Reena.
- You did this because it's me.'

02:45:21.736 --> 02:45:22.686
'Reena!'

02:45:23.406 --> 02:45:25.316
I need to tell you all something.

02:45:33.056 --> 02:45:37.436
The reason for all these
problems is not Reena.

02:45:40.896 --> 02:45:41.726
It's Manasa.

02:45:50.306 --> 02:45:52.736
Without Reena's knowledge

02:45:52.966 --> 02:45:58.026
Manasa was the one who
mixed alcohol in Reena's mocktail.

02:46:04.436 --> 02:46:05.726
Why would Manasa do that?

02:46:06.356 --> 02:46:08.146
And what proof do you
have that she did this?

02:46:09.436 --> 02:46:13.606
You know that there is a cold war
between Manasa and Reena.

02:46:14.836 --> 02:46:19.226
So, Manasa did this to create
a problem between you and Reena.

02:46:20.726 --> 02:46:21.716
How do you know this?

02:46:21.856 --> 02:46:23.896
Manasa wouldn't have told you this.

02:46:36.026 --> 02:46:36.766
Because..

02:46:39.016 --> 02:46:40.016
Manasa is my sister.

02:47:02.186 --> 02:47:04.396
But.. How is this even possible?

02:47:05.466 --> 02:47:10.856
There is no mention of a sibling
in Manasa's personal details.

02:47:11.606 --> 02:47:12.436
No, ma'am.

02:47:12.726 --> 02:47:14.396
Manasa is my biological sister.

02:47:14.436 --> 02:47:44.436
আজকের নতুন রিলিজ পেতে ভিজিট করুন:

02:47:15.606 --> 02:47:19.316
When she was born, my father
gave away Manasa to his sister.

02:47:22.146 --> 02:47:23.476
I told you who Manasa is.

02:47:25.316 --> 02:47:27.856
Now, you need to know
who my father is.

02:47:31.896 --> 02:47:33.106
My father is MNM.

02:47:38.976 --> 02:47:40.026
Madan is my brother.

02:47:41.936 --> 02:47:42.746
What?

02:47:44.226 --> 02:47:45.106
Madan?

02:47:46.476 --> 02:47:47.316
Yes, ma'am.

02:47:50.146 --> 02:47:56.526
I am the reason behind the leak
of internal affairs here, not Teju.

02:48:04.726 --> 02:48:06.436
I didn't do it for Madan.

02:48:07.406 --> 02:48:09.066
I did it for Madan's family.

02:48:11.936 --> 02:48:15.226
But I've never helped Madan
and Manasa in their wrongdoings.

02:48:16.726 --> 02:48:19.036
I've never wanted to take over
this hospital like them.

02:48:20.396 --> 02:48:22.566
You might ask why
I didn't say this sooner.

02:48:23.896 --> 02:48:26.466
But I've struggled a lot
to achieve this position.

02:48:26.766 --> 02:48:29.936
I didn't want to suffer
for their mistakes.

02:48:32.186 --> 02:48:33.016
This is the truth.

02:48:33.196 --> 02:48:35.036
I don't know if you'll believe me.

02:48:36.106 --> 02:48:37.076
Already..

02:48:38.976 --> 02:48:41.776
You threw Teju out of
this hospital because of me.

02:48:43.976 --> 02:48:46.726
Luckily, she got a second chance
and came back.

02:48:48.526 --> 02:48:51.476
Now, my other friend is
also suffering because of me.

02:48:53.396 --> 02:48:54.556
I can't bear to see it.

02:48:55.516 --> 02:48:58.106
I didn't want Reena
to suffer like Teju did.

02:48:59.976 --> 02:49:01.316
So, I told you the truth.

02:49:01.926 --> 02:49:08.316
Madan and I tried a lot to stop
Manasa. We explained a lot.

02:49:09.646 --> 02:49:11.106
But she didn't listen to us.

02:49:11.336 --> 02:49:17.146
Now, if you want to reveal
this truth to the media

02:49:18.016 --> 02:49:19.146
it's up to you.

02:49:22.566 --> 02:49:25.396
The management can take
any decision for this.

02:49:25.896 --> 02:49:28.146
Even if you fire me

02:49:29.036 --> 02:49:30.226
I'll accept it.

02:49:35.356 --> 02:49:36.356
Thank you.

02:49:36.786 --> 02:49:37.976
And sorry.

02:50:23.686 --> 02:50:25.066
Are you happy now, Teju?

02:50:28.226 --> 02:50:30.356
You asked me to tell
the truth about myself to Arjun.

02:50:31.816 --> 02:50:33.436
Now I've said everything
in front of everyone.

02:50:36.686 --> 02:50:39.896
I was looking at you
when I was telling the truth.

02:50:40.556 --> 02:50:42.936
I thought you'd try to stop me.

02:50:43.646 --> 02:50:46.186
At least,
I thought you'd nod your head.

02:50:47.936 --> 02:50:49.566
You didn't even look at me.

02:50:52.636 --> 02:50:53.476
Hey!

02:50:55.276 --> 02:50:56.606
Go home and sleep peacefully.

02:50:57.856 --> 02:50:59.606
I don't even know
if I will have my job or not.

02:50:59.656 --> 02:51:01.026
How can I sleep peacefully?

02:51:03.636 --> 02:51:04.526
Hey, nerd.

02:51:09.166 --> 02:51:10.186
I'm okay with you.

02:51:13.736 --> 02:51:14.756
What do you mean?

02:51:17.266 --> 02:51:18.996
I mean..

02:51:27.476 --> 02:51:28.886
I like you.

02:51:30.556 --> 02:51:32.026
I have decided to love you.

02:51:32.856 --> 02:51:34.596
Hey, are you mad?

02:51:35.516 --> 02:51:36.776
Why?
- Hey!

02:51:36.866 --> 02:51:38.956
I'm as good as a pauper now.

02:51:39.366 --> 02:51:40.896
I don't even know
if I have a job or not.

02:51:41.266 --> 02:51:43.226
If I go out,
I doubt I'll get a job

02:51:43.476 --> 02:51:45.146
for the things I've done.

02:51:47.066 --> 02:51:48.476
If you say you like me now..

02:51:50.686 --> 02:51:51.556
I don't understand.

02:51:54.816 --> 02:51:55.936
Hey, nerd.

02:51:57.816 --> 02:52:01.856
When they said they will
fire Reena in the meeting

02:52:02.726 --> 02:52:04.816
you didn't think about yourself

02:52:05.356 --> 02:52:07.026
and said that
you didn't want Reena to suffer.

02:52:08.766 --> 02:52:09.756
I liked that.

02:52:16.476 --> 02:52:17.356
Look here.

02:52:19.766 --> 02:52:21.566
Don't feel bad if they fire you.

02:52:22.476 --> 02:52:24.396
It's not like RK Hospital
is the only hospital out there.

02:52:24.686 --> 02:52:25.936
Isn't there any other hospital?

02:52:26.766 --> 02:52:28.226
I know a good clinic.

02:52:28.516 --> 02:52:29.316
Come there.

02:52:30.556 --> 02:52:31.366
There..

02:52:32.146 --> 02:52:36.316
There won't be any problems like
cases, positions and competitions.

02:52:37.476 --> 02:52:38.936
You can work stress-free.

02:52:41.936 --> 02:52:42.766
Not only that.

02:52:43.836 --> 02:52:49.226
We don't have to deal with
chief doctors or CEOs over there.

02:52:50.236 --> 02:52:51.936
We can be happy and peaceful there.

02:52:55.636 --> 02:52:56.476
Will you come?

02:52:59.356 --> 02:53:01.686
I'll trust you and come.
You'll take care of me, right?

02:53:03.936 --> 02:53:04.776
You come.

02:53:05.136 --> 02:53:07.046
I'll take care of you.

02:53:07.766 --> 02:53:09.086
Come.
- Hey..

02:53:09.686 --> 02:53:10.586
You're great.

02:53:10.966 --> 02:53:12.476
I'm trusting you.

02:53:23.556 --> 02:53:24.486
Hi, Arjun.

02:53:26.106 --> 02:53:31.066
I heard that they're
pressuring you to fire Reena.

02:53:33.136 --> 02:53:35.356
I'm worried about Reena.

02:53:36.606 --> 02:53:38.776
Why did you mix alcohol
in Reena's mocktail, Manasa?

02:53:39.856 --> 02:53:41.476
A-Arjun?

02:53:42.176 --> 02:53:43.896
Naveen confessed everything.

02:53:44.586 --> 02:53:45.476
About what?

02:53:46.896 --> 02:53:48.896
About you giving Reena
the drink without her knowledge.

02:53:48.936 --> 02:53:50.186
About who you are to Naveen.

02:53:50.236 --> 02:53:51.646
About why you came to the hospital.

02:53:51.686 --> 02:53:53.026
About how you are Madan's sister.

02:53:55.866 --> 02:53:58.396
I didn't expect you
to do this, Manasa.

02:53:59.316 --> 02:54:00.606
I respected you.

02:54:01.976 --> 02:54:02.976
But you..

02:54:03.936 --> 02:54:07.026
You entered our hospital
and gained all our trust

02:54:08.166 --> 02:54:09.936
and then betrayed us, right?

02:54:11.226 --> 02:54:13.036
Madan is so much better than you.

02:54:14.896 --> 02:54:17.486
He openly challenged me
to take over the hospital.

02:54:18.556 --> 02:54:20.726
At least he had the guts
to fight directly.

02:54:23.896 --> 02:54:26.146
We don't know what we're
going to do about Reena.

02:54:27.726 --> 02:54:31.146
But in your case, I know very well.

02:54:31.976 --> 02:54:34.186
In fact, I'm very clear.

02:54:37.106 --> 02:54:38.126
You're fired.

